<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">2 Leengte</book>
  <para style="h">2 Leengte</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Leengte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Leengte</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Leengte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahab shinua in Israelte tungah Moabte ahel ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin Ahaziah khu Samaria khuo a, a inn pindan tungnung vathang kikal hawm ah akie a, aliemta hi; tuachi’n thangkou mi asawl a, akung uah, “Va peita unlen, ka liemna apat kadam kia zouna diei mah chi Ekron pasien Baal-zebub va dongta un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa vansawlsiengin Tishbe mi Elijah kungah, “Kisa inlen Samaria leengpa mi sawlte houpi dingin va kuontou inlen, akung uah, Israel gam a Pasian a umlou zieh ahiei mah Ekron khuo a pasien Baal-zebub dong dinga na kuontou uh? va chi in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; Lupna na kaltou pen na kumsuh kia nawn sih dinga, na shi ngeingei ding hi” chiun, a chi hi. Tuachi’n Elijah akuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ami sawlte akunga ahing kinuale kia tahun, aman akung uah “Bang dinga hing kinuale kia nahi uoi?” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akungah, “Mikhat koute hing kimupi dingin ahing pei a, ka kung uah, Pei unlen nou hing sawl leengpa kungah nua kia unlen, akung ah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Israel gam ah Pasian umlou ahiei mah, Ekron khuo a pasien Baal-zebub dong dinga mi na sawl? tuaziehin lupna a na kaltou, na kum suh nawn sih dinga, hinanleh na shi ngeingei ding hi, va chi un, ahing na chi hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Nou hing houpi dinga hing pei, tua thu hing genpa mi bangchibang ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun adawng ua, “Ama mi mul theuthou ahia, savun kawng gahin akawng agah hi,” a chi ua; Tualeh aman “Tishbe mi Elijah avele,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n galkap sawm nga tunga lamkai agalkapte sawm nga toh asawl a; tualeh ama muol vum ah ana tou a. Tualeh aman akungah, “Nang Pasian mi Lengpa’n hing peisuh in achi hi,” ava achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in adawnga, galkap sawm nga lamkaipa kungah, “Pasian mi kahi tahpi leh van akipat in mei hing kesuh henlen nang leh na galkap mi sawm ngate hing katumta heh” achi a, tuachi’n van a kipat mei ahing kesuh a ama leh akalkap mi sawm ngate akatum siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n sawm nga lamkai dang khat leh galkap sawm nga Elijah kungah asawl kia a. Tualeh galkap lamkai pa’n, akungah “Nang Pasian mi leengpa’n kintahin hing pei suh heh achi hi!” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Elijah in adawnga, akungah, “Pasian mi ka hi tahpi leh van a kipat in mei hing kesuh henlen, nang leh na galkapte hing katum heh” achi a, tuachi’n van akipat mei ahing kesuh a, ama leh mi sawm ngate akatum siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sepai sawm nga lamkai dang akalkapte sawm nga toh asawl kia zel a, tualeh khum galkap sawm nga dang lamkaipa akuontou a, Elijah mai ah ava khupdin a, akungah “Pasian mi aw, ka hinna leh tam na suohte mi sawm nga hinna na mitmu ah manpha tahen, chi’n ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, van akipat mei ahing kie a, sawm nga lamkai nite leh a mite uh sawm nga tuoh toh akatumta uhi, hinanleh kei hinna pen na mitmu in hing manphata hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsiengin Elijah kungah “Ama toh pei suhin; zausin,” achi hi. Tualeh ading doh a leengpa kungah ama toh apei suhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman leengpa kungah, “Mangpa’n tambangin achi hi, Ekron a pasien Baal-zebub houpi dinga mi na sawl, Israel gam a thu doh ding Pasian a umlou zieh ahiei mah? tuaziehin lupna a na kaltouna akipat, na kum kia nawn sih dinga, na shi ngeingei ding ahi zaw hi,” achi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in agen Mangpa thu bangin Ahaziah ashita hi. Tualeh Ahaziah in tapa anei lou ziehin, Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat tapa Jehoram leenga apan kum ni na in ama thahengin asanggampa Joram leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahaziah tanchin dangte, Israel leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah atuong hilou a hiei mah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Elijah pumpei a van a alahtou ding lai in Elijah leh Elisha khu Gilgal a kipat in apawtkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in Elisha kungah, “Hepitahin tanah ana umtadi in, Mangpa’n Bethel a pei dingin ahing sawl hi,” achi hi. Hinanleh Elisha in “Mangpa hinna leh nangma hinna louin kagen ahi, Kang nuasie vawt sih ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Bethel ah apeikhawm suhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Bethel a um guolneite tapate Elisha kungah ahing haw ua, akungah “Tuni’n Mangpa’n nangma akipat na pu hing lahmang pieh ding ahi chi nathei ei?” achi uhi. Tualeh aman “Thei ma inge, sip khinkhien un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in Elisha kungah, “Hepitahin tanah na um tadi vawi, Mangpa’n Jerikou a haw dingin ahing sawl hi,” achi hi. Tualeh Elisha in “Mangpa hinna leh nangma hinna louin ka gen ahi, hing nuasie vawt sih vang,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Jerikou ah ahaw khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Jerikou khuo a um guolneite tapate Elisha kungah ahing pei ua akungah, “Tuni’n Mangpa’n nangma akipat na pu hing lahmang pieh ding ahi chi na thei ei?” achi ua, “Aman theima ing e, sip khin khian un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Elijah in akungah, “Hepitahin tanah na um tadi vawi, Mangpa’n Jordan a haw dingin ahing sawl hi,” achi hi. Tualeh Elisha in “Mangpa hinna leh nangma hinna louin kagen ahi, kang nuasie vawt sih ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n ani un apei khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh guolneite tapate mi sawmnga ava pei ua, amauh lamnga in gamla kuom tah ah ava ding ua, tualeh amaute gel pen Jordan ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Elijah in apuon ala a, alomziela, tui asat a, tuachi’n alangkhat tuoh ah akikhenta a, tuachi’n ani un lei gaw ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh agal kaizou tahun hichi ahing hia, Elijah in Elisha kung ah, “Na kunga kipata lahmanga ka um masangin, bang ahiei ka hing bawl pieh ding?” hing ngenin achi hi. Tualeh Elisha in akungah, “Hepitahin na Hagau tanni hing tang sah in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Sil hasapi khat na hing ngen hi, hasa nanleh na kunga kipata lahmanga ka um laitah a na hing mu leh na tang ding hi; tuachilou in vang, na tang sih ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, azawhkhawm ua ahoulim lai un, tha khat in mei sakolleng leh mei sakolte ahing kilang ua, amaute gel ahing tuom khenta a; tuachi’n Elijah khu pumpeiin van ah apeitouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha in khum amu a, “Ka pa, ka pa, Israelte sakolleng leh sakol tungtuongte aw! chi’n akikou hi. Tualeh Elijah amu nawn sih a, tuachi’n apuonte aman a, abotkeh a phalni asuota hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah puon hing kesuh zong ala a, tuachi’n anuakia-kia a, Jordan lui gei ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah puon hing kie khu ala a, tui asat a, “Elijah Mangpa Pasian hei a um atai?” achi hi. Tualeh tui asat laitahin ale langtuoh tuoh ah akikhenta a, tuachi’n Elisha agal kaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin Jerikou khuo a um guolneite tapaten amu tahun, “Elijah Hagau khu Elisha tungah umta e,” achi uhi. Tualeh ama kimupi dingin ahing pei ua, tualeh amasanga bohkhupin chibai abuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh amaun akungah, “Tu’n en in, na suohten pasal hat mi sawmnga ka umpi ua, napu sui dingin sawl in, Mangpa Hagau in ala tou a, muol tung a hiei guom sung ahiei khatah akoi khat ahi maithei hi,” achi uhi. Tualeh ama’n, “Koima sawl sih un,” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh ama dinga zumhuoi khop a anget nua un, “Kuon sah tave ua leh,” achi khongkhong hi. Tuachi’n mi sawm nga asawl ua, nithum a sui ua, hinanleh amu zouta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jerikou khuo a ani tuon laiin, akungah ahing pei kia ua, aman akung uah, “Kuon sah sihun ka chi mawng hilou amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum kho miten Elisha kungah, “Kapu un na theisa mabangin, tam kho mun anuom mama a, hinanleh atui ahoi sih a, agam ma zong bangma pien theilouna gam ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Tuithawl tha khat hing la unlen, asungah chi thun un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n tua khu akungah ahing tawi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuikhuh ah ava haw ua, tua chi khu tui sungah ava thelut a. Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Tam tui ka damsahta, tubansie shina leh nausietna aum nawnta sih ding,” chiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha in agen ma bangin tua tui khu tuni tandongin ahoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tualeh khuna kipat in Bethel ah apeitou a, tualeh lampi a apei laiin, khuo akipat in pasal naupang pawl khat ahing pawtkhie ua, ama simmawtahin, Nang lu kieupa va peitouin, nang lu kieupa va peitou in” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n akinua hei a, amauh a en a, Mangpa min in awsie alaw khum a, tuachi’n gamlah a kipat in vompi ni ahing pawtkhie a, alah ua naupang sawm li leh ni ahing bottel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuna kipat in, Karmel muol ah apei a, tualeh khuna kipat in Samaria ah a nua pei kiata hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat leenga apan kumsawm leh giet achin kum in, Ahab tapa Jehoram Samaria ah Israelte tungah leeng in apang a, tualeh kum sawm leh ni vaihawm in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa mitmu in sil gilou abawl zel a hinanleh apa leh anu bang talawm vang ahi sih hi; ama penin, a pa’n ana bawl Baallim suong phute a pai mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Israelte khelna bawlsahpa Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelnate ah abeh chinten a; apeisan nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab leengpa Mesha khu belam khawimi ahi a; aman Israel leengpa kungah belamnou tul za khat leh belamtal tul za khat amul toh kumchin in sie a sung zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Ahab shi nua in, Moab leengpa Israel leengpa tungah ahelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum hunlai in Jehoram khu Samaria khuo apat in apawtdoh a, Israelte zousie akhawmkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n apei a, Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat kungah mi asawl a, “Moab leengpa ka tungah ahel a; Moab dou dingin ka kungah nang pei diei?” achi hi. Tualeh aman “Ka hing kuontou ding hi, kei leh nang, ka mite leh na mite pum khat ihia, tualeh ka sakolte leh na sakolte zong pumkhat ahi uhi.” Achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Heilang lampi ah ikuontou diei?” achi a, tualeh Jehoram in adawnga, “Edom gamdai lampi ah” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa Juda leengpa leh Edom leengpa toh akuonta ua, ni sagi akuol pei ua, tualeh galkapte leh azawpi uh gantate adingin tui a umta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n, “E heilah! Mangpa’n tam leeng thumte Moab te khut a pieh ding a ahing khopkhawm ahi ve maw,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Jehoshaphat in akungah, “Mangpa idoh theina dingin tanah Mangpa guolnei umlou ahiei mah?” achi hi. Israel leengpa suohte lah a mi khat in adawnga, akungah “Tanah Elijah khut tui a buoh zelpa Shaphat tapa Elisha a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoshaphat in “Mangpa thu akungah aum hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Israel leengpa leh Jehoshaphat leh Edom leengpa Elisha kungah apei suhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha in Israel leengpa kungah, “Nang leh ken bang ahiei ibawl ding? napa guolneite kung leh nanu guolneite kungah vakipei ta’n,” achi hi. Israel leengpa’n akungah, “Peilou e, Moabte khuta pieh dingin tam leeng thumte Mangpa’n ahing pui khawm ahita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha in akungah “Ana ka sep galkapte Mangpa min in kagen ahi, Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat zatatlou hileng, nang kang en nuom sih dinga, mu zong ka hing mu nuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh tumging tum siem mi khat hing puiun,” achi hi. Tualeh tumging tumsiem mi in ahing tum tahin, Mangpa khut atungah ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh aman Mangpa’n “Tambang in agen hi; ‘Tam phaijang lei tawkuoh in dim sah un, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa mama in tambangin agen hi; Hui lang mawngmawng na mu sih ding ua, guo zuh lam mawngmawng zong na theikha sih ding uhi; hinanleh phaijang tuiin ahing dim dinga, tuachi’n noute leh na gantate u’leh na ganta khawi dangte un na dawn ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam pen Mangpa adingin sil neu nou khat ahi bou hi; Aman Moabte zong na khut uah ahing pieh belap nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh kulpi a ki im khopite leh khopi deihuoi te na suse ding ua, singhoi zousie na sat pua ding ua, tuikhuh zousie na hubing ding ua, tualeh gam hoi chinteng suongin na sep se sieng ding uhi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh zingmawngin ann sillat hun ding velin Edom gam langa kipat in tui ahing luong suh a, agam pumpi tuiin adimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Moabmite zousie in leengte amauh dou dingin akuontou uh chi azah tahun, galkap thei tengteng ana khawmkhawm ua, gamgi ah ana pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n zingmawng matah in athou ua, tualeh nisa in tuitung a sal a; Moab miten agal langkhat a a et u’leh tui khu sisan bang mai a san in amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh amaun “Sisan ahi, leengte ama u’leh ama uh kidou a, kithat ahi ngeingei ta ve uoh, tuaziehin Moab mite aw kisa un, agalvan lahte uh iva tuu ding uh,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte giehphuol ava tun tahun, Israelte Moabte dou dingin thakhat in akipan ua, tuachi’n ama sang uah ataizahta uhi. Tualeh Moabte that malam kawm in agam uah adellutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopite a susie ua, agam hoi zousie uh michin in suongin asep ua, suongin adim siengta hi, tualeh tuikhuh zousie ahubing ua, sing hoi zousie aphua ua, Kir-Haraseth khuo a suongte maimai ahi akhoilou uh, hinanleh saili tawiten akimkot in a imkhum ua adou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Moab leengpa’n kidouna khu ama ua dinga panna guollou a huoisie ahi chi athei tahin, namsau tawi mi za sagi apui a, Edom leengpa langa taidoh atuma, hinanleh ataidoh theita sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n atapa upa pen ama thahenga leenga hing pang dingpa khu kul dawn ah, halmang kithoina sillat in alanta hi; Israelte tungah alungthah mama ua, tuachi’n apeisan ua, agam lang uah akinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Guolneite tapate zite lah a khat in Elisha kungah, “Na suohnu ka pasal ashita a, tualeh na suohin Mangpa agiing mama hi chi na thei hi. Tualeh asum batnapa ka tapate gel ani ua a sila dinga pui ding in ahing kuon hi,” chi’n alungdonna thu genin avakap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elisha in akungah “Bang ahiei ka hing bawl pieh ding? hing hilin, na inn ah bang na nei ei?” achi hi. Tualeh amanu’n “Na suohnu’n sathau um khat chilou ngal bangma ka neisih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman pei inlen, “Na innvengte bel awng zousie va kawm in, tawmnou khat kawm sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh inn sunga na luttah chiengin, na tapate toh kot kikha khum unlen, tuachi’n tua belte ah sathau sung inlen adim masa atuom in koi zelin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n akunga kipat in apawt a, atapate toh kot akikhakhum ua, atapaten bel ahah zel ua amanu’n ana sung zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh bel teng ahing dim sieng bepin, atapate kungah “Bel hing lahbe nalai un” achia, tualeh amaun amanu kungah, “Bel a um nawn sih hi,” achi a, tuachi’n sathau akangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu ava pei a, Pasian mipa ava hilta hi. Tualeh aman “Pei inlen sathau va zua inlen, na leiba sang inlen, aval um nalai tengin na tapate toh va khosata un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh ni khat Elisha in Shunam khuo ava pha a, khunah numei neizoutah khat aum a, tualeh amanu’n ann ne dingin ana hou a, tualeh apei pouma chiengin khunah ann ne dingin alut zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n apasal kungah, “Ngaiin, tam ikunga hing tung zingpa, Pasian misiengthou khat ahi chi ka theichienta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hepitahin inn tung langah Pindan neu khat bawl pieh vai in, asungah lupna khat, dawkan khat, touna khat leh thaumei khat ikoi pieh dinga, tualeh ikunga ahing pei pouma chieng in khunah atung zel ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ni khat ava haw leh, tua pindan ah alut a, alumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n asuohpa Gehazi kungah, “Tam Shunam numei hing han vawi,” achi hi. Tualeh avahat zouin amanu amasangah ava dinga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh aman akungah, “En in, nang na hing dei sah seng senga, ken nanga dingin bang ka hing bawl pieh sam diei? Lengpa kung ahiei, ahisihleh galkap lamkai kungah hing genpieh leng na ut ei?” va chiin, achi hi. Tualeh amanu’n “Ka nam pite lah a teng ka hina hi,” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah “Bang kang bawl piehta diei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n Gehazi in adawnga, “Tapa anei ngut sih ve, apasal lah a upata ngal a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Va han vawi,” achia, tualeh ava hat zou in kotlam ah ahing dinga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Kum kia tuhun chiengin tapa na pomta ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh amanu’n akungah, “Ka dei aw pu, Nang Pasian mi in na suohnu kungah zuou gensih ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei agai a, Elisha in akunga agen bangin, akum kia tua hun ahingtun tah in tapa khat aneita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua naupang ahing khang lien a, ni khat apa kungah bu atte kungah ava kuon a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Apa kungah, “Ka lu, ka lu achi a” tualeh aman asuohpa kungah anu kungah “Vakoi in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman naupang khu apuo a, anu kung ah ahing tut a, sun dongin anu phei tungah atou a, tuachi’n ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh amanu apeitou a, Pasian mipa lupna tungah asiel a, kot akha khum a apawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n apasal ahan a, akungah, “Hepitahin tangvalte lah a khat leh sabiltungte lah a khat hing sawlin, Pasian mipa kunga kava tai a, ka hing pei kia pai theina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah “Bangzieh a tunia akunga va haw ding na hiei?” ha thalah ahi naisin, khawlni zong lah ahi sin, achi a, tualeh amanu’n “Ahoi mai ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n sabiltung tungah touna phaw apha a, a suohpa kungah “Kinaw inlen sabiltung muon pei sahsin, thu ka hing pieh sih nahpouleh hing vaigei sahsin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n apeita a, Karmel muol a Pasian mipa kungah ava tunga. Tualeh Pasian mipa in amanu gamlatah a kipat in ana mua, asuohpa Gehazi kungah, “En in khunah Shunam numei ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hepitahin amanu kimupi dingin vatai inlen, akungah, Na dam nai? Na pasal adam nai? tualeh naupang adam nai?” va chiin achi hi. Tualeh amanu’n “Damna uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh muol a Pasian mipa kung ahing tun tahin akeng atu chintena, Gehazi in amanu sawnkhieh tumin ava nai a, “Hinanleh Pasian mipa’n bangma law sin, um sah khinkhian in, alunggim senga ahi, Mangpa’n kei akipat aphuol tadi a, ahing hil nai tadi sih hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n ka pu kungah “Tapa ka hing ngen kha amah? Hing sol sin kachi sih amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha in Gehazi kungah “Na puon teng inlen kisa inlen ka chieng khut tawi inlen peiin, mi na kituohpi le zong chibai buh sinlen, mi dangin nangma chibai ahing buh u’le zong dawng sin, tuachi’n ka chieng khut khu naupangpa mai ah va ngam in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh naupang nu in akungah, “Mangpa hinna leh nangma hinna louin, ka gen ahi, ka hing nuasie vawt sih ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh adingdoh a, amanu azuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gehazi khu amautegel masangah ana pei a, tualeh naupangpa mai ah achieng khut ana ngam a, hinanleh aw leh zahna bangma a um sih hi. Tuachi’n Gehazi Elisha kimupi dingin anua pei kia a, “Naupang akhanglou sih hi” chiin ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha tua inn ahing tuntahin naupang ashi sa ana hita, ama lupna tungah alum sah na lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n alut a, ani un kot akikha khum ua tualeh Mangpa kungah thu angenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh apeitou a, naupangpa tung ah aboh khum a, akam leh akam, amit leh amit tualeh akhut leh akhut a sutuo a; tuachi’n naupang chi-lah ahing lum hii hiei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n akum suh kia a, tualeh innsungah aviel vah kawi kawi a; tualeh lupna tungah akaltou kia a, naupang tungah abohkhup kia a; tuachi’n naupang khu sagi vei ahing hahthiei a, tualeh amit ahing hahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gehazi ahan a, “Tam Shunam numei hing han vawi” achi hi. Tuachi’n ava han a, tualeh amanu akunga ahing tun in, “Na tapa pomta in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu ava lut a, akeng bul ah apua a, tuol a bohkhupin chibai abuh a, tualeh atapa apom a apawtdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha Gilgal ah ahing nuapei kia a, tualeh khum gam ah kiel atunga. Tuin guolneite tapate amasang ah ahing tou khawm ua, tualeh aman a suohpa kungah “Bel lienpi suong inlen guolneite tapate a dingin buchim huon pieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute lah a mi khat gamlah a annte lou dingin akuon a, gam umgui khat ava mu a, tuana kipat in gam um a angdim tahin alou a, ahing puo a, bang ahiei chi theiloupi in a atnen a, buchim bel ah abuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuna umte neh dingin athuata uhi. Tualeh buchim aneh laitah un, akikou ua “Aw nang Pasian mipa bel sungah shi theina um bou e,” achi ua, tuachi’n ane theita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Tangbuong themkhat hing tawi un” achi a, tualeh “Bel sungah asep lut a, tualeh aman mipite adingin thua un, ane theita ding uhi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n bel sungah bangma nehmaw ding aum nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n Baal Shalisha akipat in mi khat ahing pei a, Pasian mipa a dingin barli butha masa pen a kibawl tanghou pheng sawmni leh bu vui-tha a ip in ahing tawi a, tualeh Elisha in “Tam mite neh dingin pie in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh asuohpa’n, “Bang e, mi zakhat masang ah tami bang kachi lui diei? Aman aneh ding un tam mite pie in, achi kia a, Mangpa’n tam bangin agen hi, ane ding ua akham val nalai ding uhi,” achi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n alui a, ane ua, Mangpa chi mabangin akham val nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siria leengpa galkap lamkai Naaman khu Mangpa’n Siriate galzawna apieh ziehin, apu mitmu in mi zatat huoi leh ngaisanghuoi tah ahia, ama khu mihat leh hangsan zong ahia, ahivang in, phah natna nei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siria galkapte ahon hon in galdou in akuon ua, Israel gam akipat in numei naupang nou khat sal in ahing man ua, amanu’n Naaman zi nna asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n api kungah, “Kapu Samaria khuo a guolneipa kungah va hawleh chi tei ing e aw, aphah na suhdam pieh mai ding hi a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naaman apu inn ah ava haw a, Israel gam a naupang nu’n “Tambangin agen hi,” chiin apu avahil a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Siria leengpa’n akungah “Tu’n kisa inlen vahawin, Israel leengpa kungah lai ka hah ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n akuonta a, dangka talent sawm, sana tang tul guh, tualeh kihenna puonsil sawm akeng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa kungah “Tua laihah tambang a kigel apieh hi. “Tam laihah na mumu chiengin, ka suohpa Naaman aphah nat na sudam dingin na kungah ka hing sawl hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa’n laihah khu asim tahin apuonte abotkeh a, mite sulia a hingsah kia thei “Pasian ka hiei mah tam mipan phah sudam dinga ka kunga ahing sawl mawh? Tuaziehin hepitahin ngaituo un, thuse bawla hing phin ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, Pasian mi Elisha in Israel leengpa’n apuonte abotkeh hi chi ana zahin, leengpa kungah mi asawl a, “Bang dinga na puonte botkeh na hiei? Ama ka kungah hing sawlin, tuachi’n Israel gam ah guolnei a um chi athei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naaman asakolte leh asakollengte toh ahing pei a, tualeh Elisha tenna inn kotmai ah ava dinga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha in akungah mi ahing sawl a, “Pei inlen Jordan lui ah sagi vei vaki die in, tuachi’n na tahsa ngaima na hing pota ding a; na siengthouta ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Naaman alungthah mama a, anua peikia a, “Ngaiun, ama ka kungah ahing pei dinga, Mangpa a Pasian min ahing lou dinga, akhut apha nate tungah koi in pha hingdam sah va chi ngel hima vengin maw, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abana leh Pharpar, Damaska luite, Israel gam luite sangin ahoizaw sih amah? tuate a kisil in ka kisusiengthou theisih ding amah?” achi hi. Tuachi’n akilehei a, lungthah pum in apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asuohten Naaman ava zuon ua, akungah “Pu aw, guolnei in sil thupitah bawl in ahing chi leh nang bawllou ding na hiei mah? va kisil inlen siengthou in achi kalval bang hing chileh chinalai na hiei mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n apei suh a, Pasian mipa gen bangin Jordan lui ah sagi vei ava kidie a, atahsa naungeh chilah bangmai ahing hita a, asiengthouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naaman leh a lawite zousie Pasian mipa kungah, anua peikia ua, atun tahun amasangah ava dinga, akungah, “Ngai in, tam Israel gamsung chilou ngal, leitung pumpi ah Pasian aum sih chi ka theita, hi, tuaziehin na suohpa kipahmante hing sanpieh in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh guolnei in adawnga, “Ana ka sep Mangpa min in ka gen ahi, khat zong kala sih ding” achi a. Naaman in la maive chi’n angen va ngua a hinanleh ala nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naaman in, “Ahi sihleh kei na suohpa kungah leitang sabiltung puoh ni hepitahin hing pie in; aziehpen na suohin tua kipat in Mangpa kungah chilou ngal pasien dangte kungah sillat leh halmang kithoina mawngmawng ka lan nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam sil tungah Mangpa’n na suohpa ngaidam heh; ka pu leengpa Siriate pasien be dinga Rimmon biehinn a ka zawpi a, kei zong kava bieh a, Rimmon biehinn a kava kuontah chieng in Mangpa’n hing ngaidam heh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha in “Lungmuong tahin peita’n,” achi a, tuachi’n akunga kipat apeita a, bangtan ahiei apei manta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian mi Elisha suohpa Gehazi in, amaleh ama kihou in, “En vawi, Siria mi Naaman hing sil tawite khat zong lalou in anua pei sah kiata a; Mangpa hinna louin ka gen ahi, kava nuadel dinga, bang ahiei khat beeh kava lah pieh ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gehazi in Naaman ava nuadelta hi. Tualeh Naaman in koi ahiei in adel ana mu tahin na houpi tumin sakolleng tunga kipat in ana kum khie a, “Thuhoi lam ahi naima?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Gehazi in, “Hoilam thu hi e, a tahtah in kapu’n, Ephraim singtang gam a kipat in, guolnei tapate ni ka kungah ahing pei ua, hepitahin dangka talent khat leh kihenna puonsil ni, pie in, achi hi,” ava achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naaman in akungah, “Talent ni la maive achi a,” tuachi’n la dingin azawl va ngua a, tuachi’n dangka talent ni leh puonsil kihenna ding ni toh ip ni ah athun a, asuohte mi ni in aposah a, amasangah apeipita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha tenna muol atun tah un Gehazi in tua ip nite akhut ua, kipat alakhie a inn sungah ama’n apolut a; tuachi’n mite apei sah a, akikhenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh ama alut a, apu masangah ava dingta hi. Tualeh Elisha in “Hei a va hawta na hiei Gehazi?” achi hi. Tualeh aman “Na suoh heimah hawsing,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha in akungah, “Nang hing houpi dinga asakolleng tunga kipat tua mipa ahing kum suh laitahin hagau in na kungah ka um sih amah? Dangkate, puonsilte, Olive huonte, grep huonte, belamte, bawngtalte, suohpate leh suohnute lah hun ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin Naaman phahnain ahing man dinga, kumtawnin nahah nasuonte zong aman zel ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n akunga kipat vua banga vam in phahsa in apeidohta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh guolneite tapate’n Elisha kungah, “En in, na kunga ka um khawmna uh inn khu kou a dingin aneu seng taluo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jordan lui ah ka kuon suh ding ua, khunah zawl khat chiet kava la ding ua, ka tenna dingun khunah mun va bawlta va ung aw,” achi ua. Tualeh aman “Va kuonta un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n mikhat in “Na suohte kungah hing kuon sam ve,” achi hi. Tualeh aman “Hing kuon leng asih diei,” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n akung uah ava kuonta hi. Tualeh Jordan lui atun tah un sing aphua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh mi khat in sing aphua laiin, aheitang tui sungah aketa a, tuachi’n aman, “Ehei leh! pu mi hei kikawm pen ahi” chi’n akikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mipa’n akungah “Hei laitah ahiei akiehna?” achia; tuachi’n akiehna mun a en sah a, tuachi’n sing tuoi khat asat a, akiehna mun ah apailut a, tuachi’n heitang tuitungah ahing kilaam dohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Tawm aw le,” achi a, tuachi’n akhutin azam a, atawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siria leengpa’n Israelte akidoupi a, “Hei sung ah ina pang ding uoi” chiin agalkap lamkaite toh thu akikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mipan Israel leengpa kungah, “Tuabang mun a va suohkhalou dingin pilvang un, Siria te hing pei suh ding ahizieh un,” chi’n mi asawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa’n Pasian mipa’n ahilna mun ah mi asawl a, ava enkhe sah zel a, khunah khatvei nivei mai zong hilou in akihumbit zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam thu ah Siria leengpa alungdong seng sengta a, tuachi’n asuohte ahankhawma akung uah, “I lah ua mi koi ahiei Israel leengpa lang a pang, nang hil nuom sih ding uh amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh asuohte lah a mi khat in akungah, “Aw leengpa kapu aw, koima ka pang sih uhi; hinanleh Israel gam a um guolnei Elisha in, na pindan sunggil a na gente, Israel leengpa kungah ahil zel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Hei sunga um ahiei, kamat sah theina dingin, kuon unlen va enkhie un,” achi hi. Tualeh Ngai in, “Dothan khuo ah aum hi,” chi’n ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin aman sakolte, sakollengte leh galkap tampi asawl a, zanlai in ava kuon ua, khopi kimkot in ava imta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasian mipa suohpa zingmawng matah in athou a, ava pawtkhieh leh, sepai honin asakolte u’leh asakollengte u’toh khopi ana imkuol suohta uhi. Tuachi’n asuohpan, “Ehei lah, pu aw! bang i suoh ta diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Zau sin, amauh lam a pang sang in ei lam a pang atam zaw hi,” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha in, “Aw Mangpa, amu theina dingin amit vah sahin” chiin angen a. Tuachi’n Mangpa’n tangvalpa mit avah sah a, tuachi’n amu theita a, tualeh Ngai in, Elisha kimkot a um taangte khu mei sakollengte leh mei sakolte in a dim phengphung mai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria galkapte akunga ahing tun suh tah un, Elisha Mangpa kungah thu a ngen a, “Tam mite amit uh tawsah in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Elisha thungetna bangin amit uh atosahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu’n Elisha in akung uah, “Tami lampi ahi sih a, tamsung zong khuo ahi sih hi, hing zui unlen, na mi suipa u’kungah ka hing zawpi ding hi,” achi a, hinanleh Samaria khopi ah azawpi zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Samaria khopi sung atuntah un, Elisha in “Aw Mangpa tam mite mit vahsah in, amu theina dingun,” achia. Tualeh Mangpa’n amit uh avah sah a, amu theita uhi. Tualeh amau’te Samaria khopi sungah ana umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa’n ama uh a mu tahin Elisha kungah, “Pa, ka that diei? ka that mai diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh aman “That laizang lou ve, na namsau leh na thalpi toh na salmatte pi na that ding amah? Ann leh tui amasang uah lui pieh inlen, ne in dawn uhenlen, apu u’kungah nuapei kia uheh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n annkuong luina thupitah abawl pieh a, tualeh aneh ua adawn zou un, amaute asawldoh a, tuachi’n apu u’kung langah akinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum nua in Siria leengpa Benhadad in agalkapte zousie akhawm a, akuontou ua, Samaria khuo ava imta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh a im sawt seng zieh un Samaria khopi sungah kiel thupitah atungta a; ngai vawi, sabiltung lutang dangka sawm giet in azua ua, vakhu eeh kab khat seli suo sekhat dangka shekel nga in azua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa kulpi dawna apei laiin numei khat in “Aw, leengpa ka pu hing panpi in” chi’n ana kikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lengpa’n adawnga, “Mangpa’n ahing panpi loungal leh ken heisunga kipat in ka hing panpi thei mawh diei? buphuol akipat ahiei, grep chilna khuh a kipat in adiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n akungah “Bang ahiei na buoina?” chi’n adong kia a. Tualeh amanu’n adawnga, “Tam numei in ka kungah, tuni’n na tapa ineh dingin hing tuoh in, zing chiengin kei tapa ine kia nasih diei ahing chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n kei tapa ka huon ua, ka neta uhi. Tualeh azing ni ken akungah Na tapa ineh dingin hing tuohta ve leh ka chia, hinanleh atapa aphuol mangta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lengpa’n tua numeinu thugen azah tahin apuon abotkeh a; kulpi dawna apeilai in, mipiten a et u’leh, en in apuon nuoi ah sai ip puon ana sil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n “Leengpa’n tunia Shaphat tapa Elisha lu atahsa tunga aum nahlai pouma leh Pasian in alawlaw hing law mai heh, tua sanga zong thupi zaw in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanleh Elisha a inn ah atou a, upate zong akung ah atou uhi, tualeh leengpa’n akungah mi khat asawl a, hinanleh ami sawlpa akunga atun masangin, Elisha in upate kungah, “Tam tuolthatpa tapa in ka lu la dingin mi ahing sawl chi na thei uoile? ham sih vawi un, ami sawlpa ahing tuntah chieng in kot na kha unlen, kotkha in na dal un, anua langah apu kal suon ging akiza lah abangin?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuabanga amauh ahoupi laiin, a mi sawl pa ahing tungsuh a; tuachi’n leengpa’n, “Ngai in tam sil hoilou Mangpa hing sawl ahi; bang tan vei Mangpa ka hungai nalai diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha in “Mangpa thu na ngai un. Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; zing chieng tuhun ding vel in Samaria kulpi kotkha bul ah tangbuong nel, tena khat shekel khat in azua ding ua, barli bu tena ni shekel khat in akizua ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap lamkai akhut a leengpa kingapna khat in Pasian mipa adawnga, “En in, Mangpa’n van kottate ahon ding leh tambang silte apieng diei mah?” achi hi. Tualeh Elisha in, “Ngai in na mit in na mu ding a, hinanleh na nekha sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh kulpi lutna kotpi bul ah phah li a um ua, tualeh amauh khat leh khat akihou ua, “Bangdinga shi ngah giap a, tana tou ihi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khopi sungah lutvai chi leilah, khopi sungah kiel aum a, va shi giap ding ihi ua, tualeh tanah tou den leilah shi veve ding ihi ua. Tuaziehin kisa vawi un, Siria galkapte kung langah peivai in vakipekhe maivai in, ahing na hinkhawi u’leh ihing ding ua, ahing na tha u’leh lah ishi suh mai ding uh,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria galkapte giehphuol a haw dingin khomiel zul in akuonta uhi; tualeh Siriate giehphuol tuoh masah ava tuntah un, koima ana um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n Siria galkapte, sakollengte husate, sakol husate, galkap tampi husate bang ana za sah a; Tuachi’n “Ngai un, Israel leengpa’n Hit leengpa, Izipt leengpa te ei hing dou dingin aguoi ahita ve,” chi’n khat leh khat akihouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin khomiel zul in adingdoh ua, ataizahta uhi, apuon innte uh, asakolte u’leh, asabiltungte uh agiehphuol ua a um ngaingai bangun anuasie ua ataizah santa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh tam phahte khu Siriate giehphuol geikhieng tuohmasah pen ava tun un, puon inn khat ah avalut ua, ane un adawn ua, tualeh dangkate, sanate leh puonsilte ala ua ava phuol ua, tualeh ang pei kia ua, puon inn dangah alut ua, ava nawndoh zel ua, aphuol zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n khat leh khat akihou ua, “I bawl dan uh adih sih hi, tuni tanchin kipahhuoi tunni ahi a, i sip den ua, zingmawng khovah ingah u’leh vang, gawtna bang ahiei khat itung uah ahing tung ding hi. Tuaziehin kisa un, leengpa innkuonpite iva hil ding uhi,” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahing pei ua, khopi kotkha vengpa ahing han ua, akungah “Siriate giehphuol ah kava pei ua, ahileh koima mawngmawng ana um sih a, hinanleh sakolte, sabiltungte khisa in ana um ua, puonbuhte zong a um ngaingai in a um uhi,” chi’n ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh kotkha veng mite tua thuhoi gen in akikou ua, tualeh amaun leengpa innkuon mite ava hilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa zanlai in athou a, asuohte kungah, “Tuin Siriaten itung ua abawl dan uh ka hing hil ding. Igilkiel lamtah ahing thei ua, tuaziehin khopi apat a ahing pawt chiengun ahingin iman ding ua, khopi sungah ilut ding uhi, chia agiehphuol ua pat a kibu dinga kihemkhie ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh asuohte lah a mikhat in adawnga, akungah, “Khopi sunga sakol um sunte nga koite ahiei in vala sah inlen. En in, Israel mipi dam nalai um sunte, ngen ahi ua, tualeh ama u’zong Israel mipi beimangsate bangbang ahi uh, ka chi ahi. Tuachi’n mi isawl dinga i enkhe sah ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin sakolleng ni asakol ni toh ava la ua, tualeh leengpa’n “Pei unlen va en un” achi a, tualeh Siriate gieh phuol langah enkhe dingin asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jordan lui tandong ava nua del ua; tualeh atahtah in, Siria te akinaw zieh ua apaithang uh puonsilte leh neitah tampi lam tungtawn in athaang zengzunga, tuachi’n ami sawlte ahing kinuale ua, leengpa ahing hilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite apawtkhie ua, Siriate puon innte ava lu ua. Tuachi’n tangbuong nel tena khat shekel khat in azua ua, tualeh barli bu tena ni Mangpa thu dungzui in shekel khat in azua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n akhut angapna galkap lamkaipa khu leengpa’n kulpi kotkha veng lamkai dingin aguot a, tualeh kulpi kotkha ah mipiten amapa atuonchil ua, Pasian mipa’n akunga leengpa ava hawsuh lai a agen bangin ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian mipan leengpa kungah, “Zing chieng tuhun velin, Samaria kulpi kotkhah bul ah, tangbuong nel tena khat shekel khat in tualeh barli butena ni shekel khat in azua ding uh chia ana gen ahing tangtung ta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua galkap lamkaipa’n Pasian mipa adawng a, “Ngai in, Mangpa’n van kottate ahong ding adiei?” achi a, Pasian miin, “Ngai in namit in namu dinga, na nekha sih ding” ana chi khu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Agen dungzui in atang tungta a, mipi in kulpi kotkha bul ah atuonchil kha ua, a shi ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha in atapa shisa ahinsah pieh kia numei khu ahoupi a, a kungah, “Kisa inlen, nang leh na innkuonte na ten theitheina mun uah va teng tadi un; aziehpen Mangpa’n kiel tungsah ding ahi, tam gam ah kum sagi sung kiel tung ding ahi,” chi’n ana genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n numeinu akisa a, Pasian mipa gen bangin abawlta hi, a innkuonpite toh Philistinte gam ah kum sagi ava tengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh kum sagi bei nua in Philistin gam akipat in ahing nuapei kia ua; tualeh a inn leh lou nua nget kia dingin leengpa kungah ava hawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualaitahin leengpa khu Pasian mipa suohpa Gehazi toh ana houlim ua, “Hepitahin Elisha silbawl thupite zousie hing hil in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, naupang shisa ahinsah kia thu leengpa kunga ana gen laitahin, tua numei atapa ahin sah nu’n, leengpa kungah a inn leh lougamte ava ngen a. Tualeh Gehazi in, “Kapu Lengpa aw, tam nu ahi tua numei tualeh tam mipa ahi, atapa Elishain ahinsah kia,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n tua numei adonga, amanu’n zong agenta hi. Tuachi’n leengpa’n galkap milien khat aguot pieh a, “Amanu a nei zousie leh agam a pieng zousie toh, tam gam apawtsan akipat tuni tana te pekia siengun,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha Damaska khuo ah ahing haw a, Tualeh Siriate leengpa Benhadad achina a; tualeh “Pasian mipa tanah ahing haw hi,” chi’n ava hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Hazael kungah, “Kipahman tawi inlen, Pasian mipa houpi dingin va kuon inlen, tua ka natna akipat ka dam zou kia na diei mah? Mangpa hing doh pieh heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hazael khu Elisha houpi dingin akuon a, kipahman dingin Damaska khuo a silhoi chinteng sangawngsau sawmli puoh khop akenga; amasangah ava ding a, akungah, “Na tapa Siria leengpa Benhadad in, tami natna akipat ka damdoh kia na diei?” chiin na kungah kei ahing sawl hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha in akungah, “Pei inlen akungah na damdoh kia na ding hi, va chi in; Bangtenghileh Mangpa’n ashi veve ding hi, chi’n ahing hil hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hazael a dinga zumhuoi khopin mit sal ha in a en den a, tuachi’n Pasian mipa akapta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Hazael in akungah “Pu aw bang dinga kap na hiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n aman adawnga, “Israel tate tunga na silhoilou bawl ding ka theiziehin ahi; akulpi thupitahte uh mei in na halpieh dinga, atangvalte uh na namsau in na that dinga, ata neute uh tuol satna’n na nei dinga, anumei gailaite uh na phihkeh ding” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Hazael in “Kei na suohpa uital bep in tuabang sil thupi bawl thei ding ka hiei mah?” achia, Elisha in “Mangpa’n Siriate leengpa in na hing pang ding, chi ahing hil hi,” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha kunga kipat in apeidoh a, apu kung ah atunga, apu’n akungah, “Elisha in na kungah bang ana gen ei?” ana chia, aman “Na damdoh kia ngeingei na ding hi chi’n ahing hil hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh azing ni’n puon sa thiep thuop khat ala a, tui ah adie a, amai atuom a ashita hi. Tualeh ama thahengin Hazael leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa Ahab tapa Joram leenga apan kum ngana kum in (khum hunlai in Jehoshaphat Juda leengpa ahi) Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat tapa Jehoram leeng in apanga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lenga apan chiil lai in, kum sawmthum leh kum ni a upa ahi a, Jerusalem khuo ah kum giet vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahab innkuonte bangin, Israel leengte lampi azui a, Ahab tanu zi in anei a; tuachi’n Mangpa mit mu in sil gilou abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahivang in Mangpa’n asuoh David ziehin Juda gam asuse nuom sih a, ama leh ahah asuonten vai ahawm zing ding uh chia ana chiemsa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A dam lai in Edomte Juda tungah ahel ua, a tung ua leengpa ding akibawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin Joram-Zair khuo tandong asakolleng zousie toh akuontou a, zanlai in akisa a, ama imkhum Edommite leh asakolleng hawl lamkaite ava sim a, hinanleh ama mite apuon inn langchiet uah ataizah ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Edomte tuni tan in Judate tungah ahel nalai uhi. Khum hunlai mama in Libnah te zong ana hel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoram tanchin dangte leh asilbawl zousie Juda leengte khang thu kigelna laibu ah akigiel hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoram khu apu leh pate kungah a imuta a, apu leh pate lah ah, David khopi ah avuita uhi. Ama thahengin atapa Ahaziah leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israelte leengpa Ahab tapa Joram leenga apan kum sawm leh ni kum in, Juda leengpa Jehoram tapa Ahaziah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lenga apan chiilin kum sawmni leh kumni a upa ahia, Jerusalem ah kum khat vai ahawm a, tualeh anu min Athaliah ahia, Israel leengpa Omri tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Ahab innkuonte lampi azui a, tualeh Mangpa mitmu ah silgilou abawl hi. Ama Ahab innkote mahpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Ramoth-Gilead ah Siria leengpa Hazael toh kidou dingin Ahab tapa Joram toh akuon khawm uhi, tualeh Siriaten Joram ana suliem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Joram khu Siria leengpa Hazael toh akidouna ua, Siriaten Ramah khuo a ana suhliem na uh khu Jezereel khuo a, kisudam dingin anua kiata hi. Tualeh leengpa Jehoram tapa Ahaziah khu Ahab tapa Joram adamlou ziehin ave dingin Jezreel khuo ah ahaw suhta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh guolnei Elisha in guolneite tapate lah a khat ahan a, akungah, “Kisa inlen, tam sathau um tawi inlen Ramoth-Gilead khuo ah vahaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh nava tun chiengin, Nimsi tupa Jehoshaphat tapa Jehu va suidoh inlen, inn sungah lut inlen, tualeh aguolte lah akipat handoh inlen pindan sung gil lam ah lutpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n sathau um la inlen, alutungah sung inlen, akungah Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Israelte tunga leengpa dingin sathau kang nu hi, chi in, Tuachi’n kot hong inlen taikhie in, kihehsin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n goulnei tangvalpa Ramoth-Gilead ah ava hawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ava tun tahin, galkap lamkaite ana toukhawm ua, tualeh akungah, “Aw lamkaipu na kungah thuvaihah gen ding ka nei hi,” achia. Tualeh Jehu in “Koipen kungah e?” achia. Aman “Aw lamkaipu nangma kungah,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh adingdoh a inn sungah alut a. Tualeh guolnei in Jehu lutungah sathau asunga, Mangpa Israelte Pasian in “Tambangin agen hi; Mangpa mipi Israelte tunga leengpa dingin sathau ka hing nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka suoh zawlneite sisan leh Mangpa nasemte zousie sisan phuba Jezebel tunga kalah theina dingin napu Ahab innkuonte na that gam sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen Ahab inkuonte zousie abeimang sieng ding ua, Ahab hahlesuon pasal pouma, Israel gam a saltang hiin zalen hitaleh ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahab innkuonte Nebat tapa Jeroboam innkuonte leh Ahijah tapa Baasha innkuonte mabangin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uiten Jezreel khopi kulpi gei ah Jezebel ane ding ua, ama vuiding mi koima aum sih ding,” achia. Tualeh kot ahonga ataipawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehu apu suohte kungah ahing pawt a, alah ua mi khat in, “Hoilam thu ahina amah? tua mi mopa bangchidan a na kunga hinghaw ahiei?” achi hi. Tualeh Jehu in akung uah, “Tua mipa na thei ua, athugen zong na thei uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh amaun “Thei laizang sih unge, hinghil di ve,” achi ua. Tualeh aman “Tambangin ahing chi hi. Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Israelte leengpa dingin sathau ka hing nu hi, ang achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n kintahin akisa ua, michin in apuontuol uh asut pialpual ua, Kellei tung ah apha chiet ua; “Jehu leengpa ahita” chi’n pengkul amutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nimsi tupa Jehoshaphat tapa Jehu in Joram aguhin aphiela. (Siria leengpa Hazael ziehin Joram leh Israelte zousie in Ramoth-Gilead khuo aveng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa Joram khu Siria leengpa Hazael toh akidou lai ua, Siria miten ana suhliem uh Jezreel khuo a kisudam dingin anua kiata hi.) Tualeh Jehu in, “Kei langa pang na hi u’leh, Jezreel khuo a tam thu gen dinga pei tumte, koima tam khopi a kipat pawtdoh sahsih unlen, suohtasah sihun,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehu sakolleng khat ah atuonga Jezreel khuo ah haw dingin akuonta hi, aziehpen Joram khuna lumden ahi. Tualeh Juda leengpa Ahaziah zong Joram vave dingin ahawsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Jezreel kulpi tungah galveng khat adinga, tualeh aman Jehu leh apawlte hing pei ana mua, “Mi honpi hing pei ka mu hi” achi hi. Tualeh Joram in “Sakol tungtuongmi amauh va dawn dingin sawl inlen aman, Hoilam thu ahinai? chi’n va dong heh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh va dawn dingin sakol tungtuong mi khat akuonta a, akungah, “Leengpa’n hichi’n achi hi, Hoilam thu ahinai?” achi hi, achia. Tualeh Jehu in, “Hoilam thu ah nang thei ding bang ahiei um? ka nua ah peiin,” achi hi. Tualeh galvengpa’n “I mi sawlpa akung uah ava tunga, hinanleh ahing kinuale kia nawn sih hi,” chiin ava hil a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sakol tungtuongmi khat asawl kia a, tua mipa zong akung uh ava tunga, “Lengpa’n hichiin achi hi, Hoilam thu ahinai?” achi hi, achia. Tuachi’n Jehu in adawnga “Hoilam thu hileh hisihleh nang thei ding bang ahiei um?” ka nua ah peiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh galvengpan ama zong akung uh ava tunga, “Ahing nuapei kia nawn zel sih hi; tualeh asakolleng hawldan zong Nimsi tapa Jehu hawldan abang hi, azieh khu aman gumtah in ahawl hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Joram in “Ka sakollengte man sain koi un,” achi a, tualeh asakolleng man sain akoi ua. Tuachi’n Israel leengpa Joram leh Juda leengpa Ahaziah apawt ua; asakolleng tuoh ua tuongin Jehu dawn dingin akuon ta ua, Jezreel mi Naboth huon ah ava kituoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joram in Jehu amutah in, “Hoilam thu ahinai mah Jehu?” achi a. Jehu in adawnga, “Bang thu hoi e, Nanu Jezebel in kizuana leh dawithu abawl laisie in, hoilam thu bang ahiei um thei ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joram akinua hei a, atai kawm in Ahaziah kungah, “Kiphiel guhna aum hi, Ahaziah!” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Jehu in athalpi theitawp in akuoi a, Joram liengkop tah akap a, athaltangin alungtang avut pailet suh a, tualeh asakolleng sungah a op denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehu in agalkap lamkai Bidkar kung ah, “Domdoh inlen Jezreel mi Naboth huon sungah paiin, aziehpen apa Ahap nua a sakol tunga i ni a ituon lai a, Mangpa’n tam puohgih atunga angatsa ahita hi, chithei zing in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mangpa’n zani’n Naboth sisan leh atapate sisan ka mu tahtah nahi achi a, tualeh tammun ma ah aphuba ka la ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tuaziehin tuin dom inlen Mangpa thu bangin tam mun ngel ah paiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Juda leengpa Ahaziah in tua sil umdante amu in Beth Haggan langah ataita hi. Tualeh Jehu in anua del a, ama zong asakolleeng sungah “That doh un,” achi a, tuachi’n Ibleam kho kunga Gur zottouna ah akapliemta uhi. Tuachi’n Megiddo ah atailut a, khunah ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh amiten sakolleng khat in Jerusalem khuo ah avapuo ua, tualeh David khopi ah, apute kungah ama han ngei ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Ahab tapa Joram kum sawm leh khat leenga apan kum in Ahaziah Judate leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Jehu Jezreel khuo ava tung, chi Jezebel in anaza a; tuachi’n amitte anu a, asamte azem a, kotta ah ana en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehu kul kotpi a ahing lut laitahin, Jezebel in, “Hoilam thu ahinai ma, nang, napu thatpa, Zimri?” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n kotta lam en in adahtou a, “Koi nahi uoi kei lam apang? Koi ahiei?” achi hi. Tualeh michilge ni leh thum in ama ana ensuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman amanu “Hing paikhe suhun,” achia, tuachi’n amanu apaikhe suh ua, tualeh asisan khu kulpi bangte leh sakolte tungah akithe zengzung hi. Tualeh aman akeng nuoi ah ana tuonchil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh innsungah alut a, ane in adawn a. Tualeh “Pei unlen tam hamse thuohnu va kem unlen va vuita un, leengpa tanu ahi khu la,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n vui dinga ava kuon u’leh, alugu, akengbom leh akhutphang bomte chilou ngal amuta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahing nuapei kia ua, Jehu ahilta uhi. Tualeh aman tampen, “Mangpa’n asuohpa Tishbemi Elijah zanga ana gen, Jezreel kulpi gei ah uiten Jezebel sa ane ding uh, Ana chisa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jezebel luong umsunte zong Jezreel khuo kulpi gei a, loulai a eeh kithezah bang mai ahi dinga, tuachi’n koiman tami Jezebel ahi, achi louna dingun, chia ana gen khu ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Ahab in Samaria khopi ah tapa sawm sagi anei a. Tuachi’n Jehu in Samaria khut ah, Jezreel khuo a vaihawmte kungah, upate kung leh, Ahab tapate na kem a na khanglien sah mite kungah laithot agiela, ahahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tam laihah na mutah chieng un, napu tate na kung ua um ahia, tualeh sakollengte, sakolte, kulpi nei khopite leh galvante zong na nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na pu uh tapate lah a a hoipen leh chingpen teldoh unlen, apa leengtoupha ah tousah unlen, tuachi’n na pu uh innkuonte a dingin, dou un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute azauta mama ua, “En un, leeng nite’n zong azawlou sa uh ahia, eiten ibangchi zaw mawngmawng diei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa innsunga vaihawm lamkaite, khopi sung vaihawm liente, upate leh naupangte na kema na khanglien sahten; Jehu kungah thu ahah ua, “Na suohte ka hi ua, bawlin na chi dandan in ka bawl ding uhi, leengpa dang koima ka bawl sih ding uh, hoi nasah bangbang in bawl in” chiin mi asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua leh alaihah gel nivei na ah, “Kei lam a pang na hi ua, ka thu na zui ding u’leh napu uh tate lutang hing la unlen, zingchieng tu hunin Jezreel khuo ah ka kungah hing pei un, “chiin lai ahah kia hi. Lengpa tapate mi sawmsagi ahi ua, khopi sunga vaihawm liente leh ama uhna kemte kung ah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n laihah amu tahun, leengpa tapate aman ua, mi sawmsagi athat ua, alutangte uh bawmlang sungah aguong ua, Jezreel khuo ah, akungah ahahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n thangkoute ahing tungta ua, “Leengpa tapate lutang ahing tutta uhi,” chi’n ava hil ua. Tualeh aman kulpi lutna kotpi kungah “Mun ni in siekhawm unlen, zingmawng dongin um heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh azingmawngin ava pawtkhie a, adinga, mipi zousie kungah, “Na dihtat uhi, Ngai un, ken kapu ka phiella ka thatta hi; hinanleh tamteng pi koi tha ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahab innkuonte tungtang thu a, Mangpa’n Ana gen Mangpa thu pelhem aum sih ding chi tuin thei un, Mangpa’n asuoh Elijah zanga agen ahing tangtung sahta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehu in Ahab innkuonte Jezreel khuo a umsun teng, amilien zousie u’leh alawm kinaipi zousie tualeh asiempute khat zong hinkhawi lou in athatgam siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kisa a, apei a, Samaria khuo ah ahawta hi. Tualeh lampi a, belampute belam mul heuna inn ava tunin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehu in Juda leengpa Ahaziah sanggamte akituohpi a, akung uah “Koite nahi uoi?” chi’n adonga, Tualeh amaun “Ahaziah sanggamte ka hi uh; leengpa tapate leh leengpa nu tapate chibai buh dinga hing pei suh ka hi uhi,” chi’n adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Ahingin man un” achia, tuachi’n ahingin aman ua, belam mul heuna inn kunga lei kitou kuoh gei ah athatta hi; mi sawmli leh ni tah ahi ua, khat zong ahinkhawi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh khuna kipat a apawtkhieh nua in, Rekab tapa Jehonadab ama dawn dingin sakoltunga tuongin ahing pei a; Jehu in chibai abuh a, tualeh akungah “Na tunga lungsim dihtah ka puoh bangin, nang zong na ponai mah?” achi a, tualeh Jehonadab in “Puo e, “chiin adawng hi. Jehu in ahileh “Na khut hinghahin” achi a, tuachi’n akhut ahahtou a, aman asakolleng tungah ana kaitou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh akungah, “Ka kung ah hing pei inlen, Mangpa adinga ka phattuomngai dan hing mu in” achi hi. Tuachi’n a sakolleeng tungah atuong sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samaria khuo ahing tuntah un, Elijah zanga ana gen Mangpa thu mabangin, Samaria a umsun Ahab innkuonte asuhmang masangsien athat zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehu in mi zousie ahankhawm a, akung uah “Ahab in Baal nna themkhat ana sem a, hinanleh Jehu in nasazaw sem in asem ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Baal zawlneite zousie, ana semte zousie leh siempute zousie, ka kungah hing hankhawm un, aziehpen Baal kungah kithoina thupitah bawl ding ka hi ziehin, ahing peilou pouma hinkhawi louding ka hi,” achi hi. Hinanleh Jehu in, Baal biete zousie athagam siengtheina dinga ngien a abawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Jehu in “Baal adingin khawmpi thupitah phuong un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n aphuongta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Jehu in Israel gamsung pumpi ah mi asawl a; tuachi’n Baal bete zousie khatzong kinuasie louin ahing pei ua, khat zong akimlou aum sih uhi, tualeh Baal inn ah alut ua, tuachi’n Baal biehinn akotlam apat aning tawng dongin aluodim phingpheng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh kivonna puon kem mi kungah, “Baal be mite zousie kivonna puonte hing la in,” achia, tuachi’n kivonna puonte ahing la doh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehu leh Rekab tapa Jehonadab, Baal innsung ah ava lut ua, tualeh Baal bie mite kungah, “Baal be mite chilou ngal na lah ua Mangpa nna semte koima khat zong a umlouna dingin kisui unlen ki en kawi vawiun” achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh kithoina leh halmang sillatte lan dinga alut tahun, Jehu in inn pulam ah mi sawm giet apang sah a, akung uah, “Na khut ua ka hing pieh tam mite lah a koi ahiei khat suohta aumleh, ahinna taang uh nouma hinna in na lei ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh halmang sillat alat zou tahun, Jehu in galvengpa leh a galkap lamkaite kungah, “Va lut unlen va thatgam un; koima suohta sah sih un!” achi hi. Tuachi’n namsau in asatlia ua, tualeh galvengmi leh galkap lamkai pan, inpu lang ah apaikhie ua, tualeh Baal biehinn pindan sungah alut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Baal inn a milimte ala khie ua, ahal tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Baal suongphute asat chim gawp ua, Tualeh Baal biehinnte asawnpua ua, tuni dongin eeh buh dingin azangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuabangin Jehu in Israel gam a kipat in Baal asumang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelna, Israelte khelna abawl sahte atawpsan tuom sih a, tua khu Bethel leh Dan a sana akibawl bawngnou lim bieh khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Jehu kungah, “Ka mitmu a silhoi na bawl ziehin leh ka lungtang a um mabanga Ahab innkuonte na bawltah ziehin, natu natate khang lina tandongin, Israel leengtoupha ah atou ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh Jehu in alungtang tengteng a, Israelte Mangpa Pasian danzui ding angaisah sih a; aman Israelte khelna a puasah Jeroboam khelnate atawpsan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Mangpa’n Israelte anuasie panta a, tuachi’n Hazael in Israel gam zousie azou panpanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan akipat suolam, Gilead gam zousie, Gadte Reubente, Manassehte, Arnon lui gei a Aroer akipat in Gilead leh Bashan gam tandongin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehu tangthu dangte leh asilbawl zousie, asilbawltheina zousie khu Israel leengte khang thu gelna laibu ah a kigiel a siei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Jehu khu apu apate kungah a imuta a, Samaria khuo ah avuita uhi. Tualeh atapa Jehoahaz ama taangin leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Samaria khuo a, Israelte tunga Jehu vaihawm sung kum sawmni leh kum giet ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Ahaziah nu Athaliah in atapa ashita chi athei bepin, akisa a, leengpa tate zousie athat siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh Ahaziah tapa Joash khu, leengpa Joram tanu Ahaziah sanggam nu Jehoseba in leengpa tapa athate lah ua kipat apuimanga, adonnu toh lupna pindan ah aum sah ua, Athaliah mutheilou dingin aphuol ua, tuachi’n akithat kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama khu a donnu toh kum guh sung Mangpa inn ah phuol in aum ua. Tuachi’n khum gam ah Athaliah in vai ahawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh akum sagi na ah Jehoiada in Kerith mite leh galvengte lah a galkap za tunga lamkaite, ahan sah a, Mangpa inn a akungah ahing puilut sah a, tualeh thuhun abawlpi a, Mangpa inn ah akichiem sah a, tualeh leengpa tapa amu sah chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ama uh thu apie a, akung uah, “Tam sil na bawl ding uh ahi; na lah ua khawlni a hing kuon dingte sethum suo sekhat in leengpa inn na veng ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh sethum suo sekhat pen Sur kulpi kotpi ah na um ding uhi, tualeh sethum suo sekhat ma, galveng mite nua langa kulpi kotkha ah na um ding uhi, Tuachibangin suhsiet a aumlou na dingin inn ngah in na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh na lah ua, honni khawlni a nna sem a pawtdoh dingten Biehinn a um Lengpa na veng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh mi chin in galvan na khut ua tawi chiet in Lengpa na im kimkot ding ua, tualeh koi zong na imkimkotna sung ua hing lut pouma na that zel ding uhi, tualeh leengpa alut leh apawt chiengin na zui kawikawi ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Jehoiada in thu apieh bangin galkap za te tunga lamkai ten abawl ua, tualeh amauh pawlte chiet khawl ni a, hing kuon ding te leh khawlni apei dingte, apui ua, siempu Jehoiada kungah apei zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh siempuin galkap za te tunga lamkaipa kungah, Mangpa biehinn sunga um David teipi leh lum apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh galveng galkapten galvan tawi chietin Biehinn ning zietlam akipat veilam ning tan in, maitam leh biehinn kimkot in leengpa adin khum metmut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiada in leengpa tapa pulam ah ahing puidoh a, leenglukhu akhusah a, theipitu hina apie a, tuachi’n leengpa in abawl ua, sathau anuta uhi, tuachi’n akhut uh abeeng ua, “Lengpa damsawt hen,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Athaliah in galveng galkapte leh mipite husa azah tahin, Mangpa inn sunga mite kungah ava haw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh a et leh, ngaina dan dung zuiin khuom zul ah ana dinga; tualeh leengpa kungah mi liente leh pengkul mutte ading uhi. Tualeh gamsung mi zousie kipah sengsengin pengkul amut uhi. Tuachi’n Athaliah in apuontuol abotkeh a, “Kiphielguhna, Kiphielguhna, ahi,” chiin akikou zahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh siempu Jehoiada in galkap za te tunga lamkai dinga kiguongte thu apia a, akung uah “Galkapte kikaal ah pawt sah unlen, koipou ama zuite namsau a satlia ding ahi,” achia, aziehpen siempupa’n “Mangpa biehinn sungah that sihun” ana chi zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu aman ua; leengpa inn huong sunga sakolte lutna lampi ah apei a, khunah athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiadain Mangpa mite ahina ding un, Mangpa leh leengpa, tualeh mipite kikaal ah thuhun abawl a, tualeh leengpa leh mipite kikal ah zong abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n agamsung mipite zousie Baal inn ah alut ua, asu chim ua, amaitamte leh amilimte asat nen dildel ua, tualeh maitam maiah siempu Mattan athat ua. Tualeh siempu Jehoiada in Mangpa inn veng lamkai ding mite aguot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap za te tunga lamkaite, galveng ding galkapte, tualeh mipite zousie azawpi a, tuachi’n leengpa khu Mangpa inn a kipat in azawpi suh ua, galveng galkapte umna kulkotkhah lutna lampi langah apeipi ua, leengpa inn ah atung ua. Tuachi’n leengpa leengtoupha tungah atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum gam a mizousie akipah ua, tualeh khopi buoilou in aumta hi. Tualeh Athaliah khu leengpa inn ah namsau in athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joash leenga apan kipat chiil laiin kum sagi a upa ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehu leenga apan kum sagi na in, Joash leeng in apanga, Jerusalem khuo ah kum sawm li leeng in apanga anu min Zibiah ahia, Beer-sheba khuo mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siempu Jehoiada in athuhil sungsiein Joash in adamsungin Mangpa mitmu ah silhoi abawl ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh mun sangte phiet mang sieng ahi tuom sih a, mun sangte ah mipite akithoi ua, gimnamtuite zong ahal nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Joash in Siempute kungah “Mangpa inn a hing kitawilut, kithoina sillat siengthoute, kisimna sumte, mimal kichiemna sumte, ama kiphalna banga hing kitawilut sumte zousie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siempu tengin ama u kung chiet a hing kithoite hing tawi sumte nala uhenlen; tuachi’n inn sietna zousie bawlpha uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa Joash kum sawmni leh thum leeng a apan sung in zong siemputen tua inn sietnate abawlpha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Joash in siempu Jehoiada leh siempu dangte ahankhawma akung uah, “Bangdinga Mangpa inn sete bawlphalou na hi uoi? Tu a kipat in na kung ua kithoi dia hing peite kunga kipat sum la nawn sih unlen, inn sie bawlna dingin pekhe zota un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n siemputen mite kunga kipat a sum lah nawnlou leh inn sietnate bawllou pha asata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Jehoiada in singkuong khat ala a, asitna avutvanga, Mangpa inn lutna zietlam panga maitam siih ah akoi a, Mangpa inn a sum hing tawilut zousie khuna kotkha veng siemputen ana koilut pieh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua singkuong sungah sum tampi aum chi atheitah un, leengpa lai giel mi leh siempu lien pen ahing pei ua, ip sungah akoi ua, Mangpa inn a sum um khu asim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n asum sim uh Mangpa inn a nasem mite lamkaite khut ah ape khie ua; tualeh amaun Mangpa inn a nasem a um sing bawlsiem mite leh inn bawl mite thaman dingin ape zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suong khengte leh suong gielte kungah Mangpa inn sietna munte bawlphatna dinga sing leh suongte leh inn bawlna akul leh poimawna a zah dingin apekhe zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahivang in Mangpa inn sunga sum ahing tawite un, Mangpa inn a ding dangka kuongte, puontena bahte te leh tuithena noute leh pengkulte leh sana akibawl bel photphot ahisihleh dangka bel pouma abawl sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh tuate khu nasem mite kungah ape zel ua, tuate Mangpa inn bawlna in azang zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh nasem mite pieh dinga, sum akep sah mite uh zong a et zuipi tuom sih uhi, aziehpen ama un gin umtah in abawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tatkhielna thoina sumte leh khelna thoina sumte khu, Mangpa inn ah ala lut sih uhi, tuate khu siempute tanvou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria leengpa Hazael akuontou a, Gath ava sim a, alata hi; Tualeh Hazael Jerusalem lam a kuon dingin akisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Judate leengpa Joash in Juda leengte apute, Jehoshaphat, Jehoram leh Ahaziahten ana latsa uh, silsiengthou zousie leh ama sil siengthou zousie, tualeh Mangpa inn leh leengpa inn a gou koikhawmna a um sana zousie ala a, Siria leengpa Hazael kungah ahah a, tuachi’n Hazael in Jerusalem anuasie a, apei kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Joash tanchin dangte leh asilbawlte zousie Juda leengte khangthu kigelna laibu sungah akigiel hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh amite akipan ua, a sawm dap ua, Joash khu Silla zot suhna lampi a Millo inn sungah athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama mite Shimeath tapa Jozakar leh Shomer tapa Jehozabad ten athat uhi; tuachi’n apulepate kungah David khopi ah avui ua, tualeh atapa Amaziah ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judate leengpa Ahaziah tapa Joash kum sawmni leh thum leenga apan kum in, Jehu tapa Jehoahaz Israelte tungah leeng in apanga, tuachi’n kum sawm leh sagi leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu in silgiloutah abawla, Israelte khelna bawlsahpa, Nebat tapa Jeroboam gitlounate aman zong azui a, apeisan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa lungthahna khu Israelte tungah a kuongzahta hi. Tuachi’n Siriate leengpa Hazael khut ah ape kheta, tualeh adam sung nite uh Hazael tapa Ben-Hadad khut ah apekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoahaz in Mangpa kungah nget chitahin angen a, tuachi’n Mangpa’n a thunget angaikhie a; Siria leengpa’n Israel te a bawl gen thei seng zieh in, tualeh a nuoisie nate athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siriate khut akipat asuotat theina dingun Mangpa’n Israelte kungah hundampa khat apie a; tuachi’n nidanglai mabangin Israel tate apuon inn uah atengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Israelte khelna bawlsahpa Jeroboam innkuonte khelna ataisan sih ua, azuiden ua, tuachi’n sing a kibawl milimte khu Samaria khopi ah a um den nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoahaz khu amite lah ah, sakol tungtuong mi sawm nga leh sakolleng sawm leh galkap tul sawm chiloungal adang nei ding aphal pieh sih hi; aziehpen Siria leengpa’n asumanga, leivui chil buongbangin abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoahaz tangthu dangte, asilbawl zousiete leh asil bawltheinate, Israel leengte khangthu kigelna laibu sungah akigiel sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoahaz khu apu leh pate kungah a imuta a, tualeh Samaria khopi ah avui ua, tualeh ama thahengin atapa Jehoash leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda leengpa Joash leenga apan kum sawm thum leh sagi ahi in, Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash khu Samaria khuo ah leeng in apanga, tualeh kum sawm leh guh leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawla, Israelte khelna bawlsahpa Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelnate anuasie sih a, abawl zom zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoash tanchin dangte, asilbawl zousie, Juda leengpa Amaziah adou lai a, asil bawlthei dante, Israel leengte khangthu kigelna laibu ah akigiel a siei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoash apulepate kungah a imuta a, tuachi’n Jeroboam aleeng toupha tungah atou a, tualeh Jehoash khu Samaria khopi a Israel leengte kungah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha khu ashipi ding natna in achinata a. Tualeh Israelte leengpa Joash akungah ava hawsuh a, amasangah ava kapta a, “Aw ka pa, ka pa, Israelte sakolleng leh sakol tungtuong mite lamkaipa,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha in akungah “Thalpi leh thal tangte la in,” achia. Tuachi’n aman thalpi leh thaltangte ala a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tualeh Israel leengpa kungah “Thalpi nakhut in tu in” achia. Tualeh aman atu a. Tualeh Elisha in Israel leengpa khut tungah atuhkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n akungah “Suolam kotkhah hong vawi” achia. Aman ahonga. Tuachi’n Elisha in “Kaap in” achia. Tuachi’n aman akaapta a. Tualeh akungah “Mangpa hundamna thal, Siriate akipata hundamna thal ahi. Aphek khuo ah Siriate sumangthai khopin na zou ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh aman “Thaltangte la in” achia, tualeh leengpa’n ala a. Tualeh aman Israelte leengpa kungah “Tuol sun in” achia; Tuachi’n thumvei asun a akhawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mipa khu atungah alungthaha, “Nga vei guhvei na sut ding ahia; tuachi’n Siriate mangthai sieng khopin na zou ding hi, Tuin ahileh Siriate thum vei bep zou ding na hita ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Elisha ashi a, avuita uhi. Tualeh akumkia in Moab galkap honin agam uh ahing sim ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, Mi khat avui kuon laitah un, galkap hon khat amu ua; tuachi’n tua mi shipa khu Elisha han sungah asep lut ua; tualeh aluong in Elisha gute asuh khah tahin, ahingkia a, adingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Siria leengpa Hazael in Jehoahaz damsung tengin Israelte anuoisie ngitnget a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n, Abrahamte, Isaak leh Jakobte kunga athuhun ziehin, amauh ahepi a, alainat a, angaisah a, amasanga kipat in asumang nuom sih a, akunga kipat apaikhe nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria leengpa Hazael ashita a, ama thahengin atapa Benhadad leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash in Hazael tapa Benhadad in apa Jehoahaz asim lai a, khuo alah piehte anua lah pieh kia sienga, Joash in thum vei azou a, Israelte khopite ala kia sieng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel leengpa Jehoahaz tapa Joash leenga apan kum ni nain Juda leengpa Joash tapa Amaziah Juda te tungah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lenga apan chiillai in kum sawmni leh nga ahia, tualeh Jerusalem ah kum sawmni leh kuo leeng in apang hi. Tualeh anu min Jehoadan, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa mitmu in sildih leh hoitahte abawla, hinanleh apu David abang zou sih hi; Apa Joash bawl bangin sil zousie abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangtenghileh, mun sangte aphietmang sih a, mipite munsangte ah akithoi ua, gimnamtuite ahal nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh akhut a leenggam suhkip ahing hitahin, apa leengpa ana that amite athat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tuolthat tate, athat kha sih hi, Mosi dan laibu a, kigiel, tate zieh in pate suhlia ahi sih ding a, “Pate ziehin tate suhlia ahi sam sih ding hi; michin ama khelna ziehin ashi ding uhi, chia, Mangpa thu pieh bangin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman chi phaijang ah Edom mite tul sawm athat a, Selah khuo adou a, alata hi, tualeh amin dingin tuni dongin Joktheel akichita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amaziah in Israel leengpa Jehu tapa Jehoahaz tapa Joash kungah, “Hing pei inlen kimaituo in iki en ding,” chia gen dingin mi asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa Jehoash in, Juda leengpa Amaziah kungah “Lebanon taanga lingin Lebanon taanga sidar sing kungah mi asawl a, Na tanu ka tapa zi dingin hing pie in, achia, tualeh Lebanon taanga gamsa ahing pei a, tua ling khu ahing tuonchilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Edomte nava zou ngut ma a, na lungsim a hing ki uongsah nahi tave, na thupina inn ah umpi khinkhian in, Bang dinga na sietna ding leh Judate nangawn in na kieh ngiem lawna ding uh, sil bawl kawi na hiei mah?” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Amaziah in ana ngaikhe nuom sih a. Tuaziehin Israel leengpa Jehoash akuontou a, tuachi’n ama leh Judate leengpa Amaziah Juda gam a Beth-Shemesh ah kimaituo in aki-enta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Judaten Israelte azou sih ua, aguollelta ua, michin apuon inn lam chiet uah ataita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa Jehoash in, Ahaziah tapa Jehoash tapa Juda leengpa Amaziah khu Beth-Shemesh ah aman a, tuachi’n Jehoash Jerusalem ah apei suh a, Jerusalem kulpi Ephraim kulkotkhah akipat kotkha ningta pen dongin tong za li asu chim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa inn leh leengpa inn a gou koikhawm na a, sana, dangka leh tui uum bel suon zousie amu taphot ala a, Samaria khopi ah akinuale ta hi, tualeh aman thuchiem tangtunna dinga hentanga umte zong azawpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoash tanchin dangte leh asilbawlte leh asilbawltheidante, Juda leengpa Amaziah toh akidou dante, Israel leengte khang thu kigelna laibu ah akigiel asiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoash apu a pate kungah a imuta a, Samaria khopi a Israel leengte lah ah avuita uhi. Tualeh ama thahengin atapa Jeroboam leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Juda leengpa Joash tapa Amaziah khu Israelte leengpa Jehoahaz tapa Jehoash shi nua in kum sawm leh nga adam nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amaziah tanchin dangte khu, Juda leengte lal lai khangthu gelna laibu ah agiel sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem ah ama kalin aguh in thu aphiel ua, tualeh Lakish khuo ah atai a, hinanleh Lakish khuo a ama nuadel dingin mi asawl ua, khunah athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh aluong sakol in ahing puo ua, David khopi Jerusalem ah apu a pate kungah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Juda mipi zousiein kum sawm leh kumguh a upa Azariah azawpi ua, apa Amaziah thahengin leengpa in abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman Elath khuo abawl hoi kia a, Juda gam ah aum sah kia a, tuazouin leengpa apu a pate kungah a imu ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda leengpa Joash tapa Amaziah kum sawm leh kum nga leenga apan kum in, Israel leengpa Joash tapa Jeroboam Samaria khuo ah leeng in apanga, tualeh kum sawm li leh khat leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu in silgilou pipi abawl zel a, Israelte khelna a na puilut pa Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelnate zousie ataisan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mangpa Israelte Pasian in asuohpa Gath-hepher khomi Amittai tapa goulnei Jonah zanga athu gen bangin, Hamath lutna akipata Arabia tuipi dongin Israel gam ah apang sah kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n Israelte gentheina ahuoise mama chi athei a, saltang hi in zalen hita u’leh Israelte panpi ding koima aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Israelte min vannuoi akipat a suhmang ding ana genkha mawngmawng sih a; Joash tapa Jeroboam zangin ahundam zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeroboam tanchin dangte, a nasep zousie leh asilbawltheidante, agaldou thute, tu masang lai a, Juda gam a na um Damaska leh Hamath khopite, Israelte adinga ana nualah pieh kia thute, Israel leengte khangthu kigelna laibu ah akigiel asiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeroboam khu apu leh pa, Israel leengte kungah a imuta a, tuachi’n atapa Zekariah ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel leengpa Jeroboam kum sawmni leh sagi leenga apan kum in, Juda leengpa Amaziah tapa Azariah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lenga apan chiillai in kum sawm leh kumguh a upa ahia, tualeh Jerusalem ah kum sawmnga leh ni leeng vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh apa Amaziah bawl bangbangin, Mangpa mitmu in sil hoi tahtah abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh munsangte phietmang ahi tuom sih a. Munsangte ah mite akithoi nalai lai ua, gimnamtuite ahal ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n leengpa agawt a ashi todongin apha a, inn tuom ah ateng hi. Tualeh leengpa tapa Jotham in agam mite vai ahawm pieh a, leeng innsung vaihawm lamkai in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Azariah tanchin dangte, asilbawl zousie Juda leengte vaihawmna khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hi lou a mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Azariah apu a pate kungah a imuta a, tualeh David khopi ah apu apate kungah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judate leengpa Azariah leenga apan kum sawmthum leh giet kum in Jeroboam tapa Zekariah Israelte tungah Samaria khopi ah haguh leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh apa bawl mabangin Mangpa mitmu ah silgilou abawla, Israelte khelna bawlsahpa Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelnate apeisan tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Jabesh tapa Shallum in ama aguhin aphiel a, mipite mai ah asuol a athat hi; ataangin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zekariah tanchin dangte, ngaiin, Israel leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam khu Mangpa’n Jehu kunga anagen, “Na tapate khang lina tanin, Israelte leeng toupha ah atou ding uh,” achi khu ahing tangtung tahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judate leengpa Uzziah leenga a pankum sawmthum leh kuo ahi in, Jabesh tapa Shallum leeng in apang hi, Tuachi’n ha khat pumlum leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Gadi tapa Menahem Tirzah khuo akipat in akuontou a, Samaria khuo ah atunga, Samaria khuo ah Jabesh tapa Shallum ava satlum a, ama taangin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n tanchin dangte a mi phielguhna thute ngai in Israel leengte vaihawmlai khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Menahem in Tirzah akipat in Tiphsah khuo leh asunga um zousie leh agamte ava sim hi, aziehpen ama un akotpite uh ahon pieh nuom sih uhi. Tuachi’n khopi sunga numei gailai zousie aphihkeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda leengpa Azariah kum sawmthum leh kum kuo leenga apan kumin, Gadi tapa Menahem Israelte tungah leeng in apang hi, tualeh Samaria ah kum sawm leeng vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawla, adamsung tengin Israelte khelna bawlsahpa Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelnate atawpsan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Asiria leengpa Pul in, agam ahing dou a, tualeh ama panpina anga theina ding leh aleenggam asuhhat pieh theina dingin Menahem in Pul kungah dangka talent tul khat apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Menahem in Asiria leengpa pieh dingin Israel mi hausate kungah Dangka shekel sawm nga chiet akhonkhawm a, tuachi’n Asiria leengpa akinuale kiata a, agamsungah a umdenta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Menahem tanchin dangte, anasep zousie Israel leengte khangthu kigiel na laibu ah akigiel asiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Menahem khu apu apate kungah a imuta a, tuachi’n atapa Pekahiah ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda leengpa Azariah kum sawm nga leenga apan kum in, Menahem tapa Pekahiah Israelte leeng in apanga, tualeh Samaria ah kumni sung leeng vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pekahiah in Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawla; tualeh Israelte sil bawlkhiel sahpa, Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelnate atawpsan dieh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh galkap lamkai Remaliah tapa Pekah in ama aguhin aphiela, Argob leh Arieh toh Gilead mi sawm nga azawpi a; Samaria khuo a leengpa inn huongsungah, asuol ua, athatta ua, tualeh ama taangin leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Pekahiah tanchin dangte, anasep zousie Israel leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Juda leengpa Azariah kum sawm nga leh kum ni leenga apan kum in, Remaliah tapa Pekah Israelte leengpa in Samaria khopi ah apanga, kum sawmni leeng vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawl a, Israelte khelna bawlsahpa Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelnate atawpsan tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel leengpa Pekah vaihawm laiin, Asiria leengpa Tiglath-Pileser ahing kuon a, Izon, Abel, Beth, Maakah, Janoah, Kedesh, Hazor, khuote zousie leh Gilead leh Galili gamte leh Naphtali gam zousie ala a, tualeh amipite, Asiria gam ah sal in azawpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elah tapa Hoshea in Remaliah tapa Pekah aphiel gu a, tualeh adou a, athatta a; tuachi’n Uzziah tapa Jotham kum sawmni leh nga apan kum in, ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pekah tanchin dangte, asilbawl zousie, Israel leengte khangthu gelna laibu sung ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel leengpa Remaliah tapa Pekah leenga apan kumni na in Juda leengpa Uzziah tapa Jotham leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lenga apan chiillai in kum sawmni leh kumnga a upa ahia, tualeh Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh kum guh leeng vai ahawma. Tualeh anu min Jerusha ahia, Zadok tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mangpa mitmu in sildih abawla, apa Uzziahin ana bawl zousie mabangin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh munsangte aphietmang sih a, munsangte ah mipite akithoi ua, gimnamtuite ahal nalai uhi. Aman Mangpa inn kotpi sahtazaw abawl hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jotham tanchin dangte, asilbawl zousie Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hilou a mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Siria leengpa Rezin leh Remaliah tapa Pekah khu Judate dou dingin Mangpa’n asawl patna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh Jotham apu leh pate kungah a imuta a, apu David khopi ah apu leh pate kungah akivuita hi. Tualeh ama thahengin atapa Ahaz leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remaliah tapa Pekah, kum sawm leh sagi leenga apan kum in, Juda leengpa Jotham tapa Ahaz leeng in apang pan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lenga apan chiillai in Ahaz kum sawmni a upa ahia, Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh guh leeng in apang hi. Apu David bangin Mangpa a Pasian mitmu in silhoi abawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel leengte gamtat bangin agamta hi; Mangpa’n Israel tate masanga adeldoh namten sil kidahhuoi tah abawl zel bangun atapa mei ah kithoina in alan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh munsangte, muoltungte, tualeh sing hing nuoi chintengah akithoi a, gimnamtui ahal zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria leengpa Rezin leh Israel leengpa Remaliah tapa Pekah khu Jerusalem dou dingin akuontou ua, tualeh Ahaz a im ua, hinanleh azou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Siria leengpa Rezin in Elath khuo Siria gam a dingin anualah kia a, Elath khuo akipat Judate adeldoh hi. Tuachi’n Siriaten Elath khuo ava luo ua, tuni tan in ateng nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahaz in Assiriate leengpa Tiglath-Pileser kungah, “Na suohpa leh na tapa ka hi, kei hing dou dinga hing kuon Siria leengpa leh Israel leengpa khuta kipat hing hunkhie in” chi’n mi asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Ahaz in Mangpa inn leh leengpa inn a gou koi khawmna a um dangka leh sana teng ala a, Assiria leengpa kungah kipahman dingin ahah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa’n athugen ana pom a, tuachi’n Assiria leengpa Damaska khopi sim dingin akuontou a, ava la a, tualeh a mipite Kir gam ah sal in azawpi a, Rezin athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Ahaz khu Assiria leengpa Tiglath-Pileser kimupi dingin Damaska khuo ah ahaw a, tualeh Damaska khuo a maitam khat avamu a; tuachi’n leengpa Ahaz in tua maitam lim a bawldan bangbang et ton dingin siempu Urijiah kungah ahah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Urijiah in leengpa Ahaz in Damaska akipata ahah bangbangin maitam khat ana bawla; tuachi’n siempu Urijiah in, Lengpa Ahaz Damaska akipat a ahing kinuale kia masangin ana bawl zou siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Damaska akipata leengpa ahing tuntahin, leengpa’n maitam khu amu a; tualeh leengpa’n maitam ava zuon a, atungah sillat alanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh maitam ah halmang sillatte hal in, ann sillatte alan a, dawn sillatte asungbuo a, tualeh kilemna sillat sisan zong athe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa masanga um sum-eng maitam, Mangpa inn leh maitam kikaal a um khu ala khie a, mallam pangah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Ahaz in “Maitam lienpi tungah zingmawng halmang sillalte, nitah lam ann sillalte, leengpa halmang sillalte, gamsunga mipite zousie sillatte leh a ann sillalte u’leh dawn sillalte toh hal inlen lan in; tualeh halmang sisan sillatte zousie leh kithoina sisan zousie atungah the inlen, tualeh sum-eng maitam khu keiman ka houpi na ding hi,” chiin siempu Urijiah kung ah thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n siempu Urijah in leengpa Ahaz thupieh bangbangin abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Ahaz in atunna kuohte asusie a, asunga kisilna kuongte khu ala doh hi; tualeh atunna sum-eng bawngtalte akipat tuikuongpi khu alakhie a, suong kilem tungah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh khawlni ading atungnei lampi biehinn a abawl u’leh, biehinn pulama leengpa lutna pen zong Assiria leengpa kipah sahna dingin alakheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lengpa Ahaz tanchin dangte asilbawlte, Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah atuong hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Ahaz apulepate kungah a imuta a, apu leh pate kungah David khopi ah avuita uhi. Tualeh atapa Hezekiah ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Ahaz kum sawm leh kumni leenga apan kumin, Ela tapa Hoshea Israelte tungah Samaria khopi ah leeng in apanga, kum kuo leeng vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu in silgilou tahtah abawla, hinanleh ama masanga Israel leengte bang zen in vang abawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assiriate leengpa Shalmaneser in ava sim a, tuachi’n Hoshea khu asuohin apanga, siete ape zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Assiria leengpa’n Hoshea in aguhin ana deeh hi chi athei a; aman Izipt leengpa So kungah mi asawl a, tuachi’n kum chin a, apieh zel bangin Assiria leengpa kungah sie apeta sih hi. Tuaziehin Assiria leengpa’n ama hensa in suongkul ah akhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa’n gam pumpi atuon suoh sienga, tualeh Samaria ah akuontou a, kum thum sung ava umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoshea kum kuo leenga apan kum in, Assiria leengpa’n Samaria ala a, tualeh Israelte Assiria gam lam ah, apuimanga, Halah gamte leh Gozan lui kunga Habor gamte tualeh Medes khopite ah aum sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuabanga ana umna ziehuh pen, Israel taten Izipt leengpa Pharaoh akipat leh Izipt gam a kipata amauh puidohpa Mangpa a Pasian uh tungah sil abawl khiel ua, pasien dangte agiing zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n Israel tate masanga adeldohsa namte tawndan leh Israel leengten apom uh khelnate azui zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mangpa a Pasian uh tungah sil hoilou aguhin abawl zing ua, akhuote zousie uah galveng mi umna kulpi nei khuote tandongin munsangte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh muol sangte leh sing hing nuoi chinteng ah milimte atung ua, Asherte a phut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh amasang ua kipat a, ana deldohsa namte bawl bangbangin munsangte ah gimnamtuite ahal zel ua; tualeh Mangpa lungthah sah dingin silgilou tahtah abawlbe nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n akung ua “Tam silte na bawllou ding uh ahi” chia, Agen milimte nna zong asemsem nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n na umdan hoiloute uh tawpsan unlen, napu napa te uh kunga Kana thupieh leh Ka suoh zawlneite zanga Ka hing theisah dan zousiete dungzuiin “Ka thupiehte leh Ka dante zui un chi’n guolneite leh mutheite zousie zangin Israelte leh Judate thu ana theisah hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh angaikhe nuom sih ua, apu leh pate un Mangpa a Pasian uh gingta nuomlou a, alungtangte uh akhausah mabangun apaupeng zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh apu apate uh kunga thupiehte thuhun ana bawlte adei sih ua, akung ua Atheisah Athu theisahte zong khawh asa sih uhi. Tualeh amauh tung thu a, Anathupieh, amaute bawl banga na bawl ding uh ahisih, chia Ana gen akim avel ua nam umte zui in, milimte abie ua, azuoutat ua, sil phatuomlou milimte nna sem in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa a Pasian uh thupieh zousie anuasie ua, bawngnou lim sunthu ni abawl ua, tualeh Asher abawl ua, van a um zousie abie ua, Baal nna asem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh atapate u’leh atanute uh kithoina in meikuong lai ah apai ua, aisante leh bumte achiing ua, Mangpa suthangpai dingin Amit muin silgilou tahtah bawl dingin akizua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa khu Israelte tungah alungthahta sengsenga, Amuphahlouna ding ah asuonmanga; Juda nam chiloungal koima a hen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judaten zong Mangpa a Pasian uh thupieh azuita sih ua, Israelte tawndan bawlthute azui zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Israel hahle suonte adei nawn sih a, amaute agenthei bawla, amuphah louna dinga apaimang masang sie in, amauh sugentheite kungah apekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa’n Israelte pen David innkuonte apat in abotkheta a, tualeh amaun Nebat tapa Jeroboam aleengpa dingun abawl ua, tualeh Jeroboam in Israelten Mangpa azuilai uh apaimanga khelna thupitah abawl sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen Jeroboam in ana bawl khelnate Israel taten ataisan sih ua, azui zing zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mangpa’n asuoh aguolneite zanga Ana gensa banga, Israelte Amitmu apata, asuonmang masang siein. Tuachi’n Israelte ama uh gam ngei akipat in Assiria gam ah apui ua, tuni tanin aum nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa’n Babilon khuo a mite, Kuthah khuo a mite, Ava khuo a mite, Hamath khuo a mite, tualeh Sepharvaim khuo a mite, ahing zawpi a, Samaria gam khuote ah, Israel mite munte aluo sah a, tuachi’n akhuote uah atengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh khuna aten chiillai un Mangpa agiing sih ua; tuaziehin Mangpa’n alah uah humpibahneite asawl a, tuachi’n mi Phabepkhat athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun Assiria leengpa kungah, “Samaria khuote ateng dinga na lahdoh namten, agam Pasian biehdan athei sih ua; tuaziehin alah uah humpibahneite asawl a, tualeh ngaiin, tam gam Pasian biehdan atheilou ziehun athat zel uhi,” chi’n agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa’n, khuna sal a na hing puidoh uh, siempute lah a khat zawpi unlen; “Ama va peiin vateng sam henlen, tuagam Pasian biehdan vahil heh,” chi’n thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samaria khuo akipata apuimang uh, siempute lah a khat, ahing pei a, Bethel khuo ah ava tenga, tualeh Mangpa giindan siemdan ding avahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh nam chin in ama uh pasien chiet abawl ua, Samaria miten munsang ana bawl innte uah, nam chin in amauten na khuo chiet ah akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babilon miten Sukoth Benoth abawl ua, tualeh Kuthmiten Nergal abawl ua, tualeh Hamath-miten Ashima abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Ava miten Nibhaz leh Tartak abawl ua, tualeh Sepharvaim miten a pasiente uh Adramelek leh Anamelek kungah atate uh mei ah ahal zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa a giing ua, alah ua um namchin lah akipat in munsang a siempu ding akiguot ua, tuaten mun sangte ah kithoina abawl pieh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mangpa agiing ua, tualeh ava puidohna gam ua namte bawldan bangbangin amauh pasiente nna asem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tumasang lai a abawl dan bangun, tuni tanin abawl nalai uhi; Mangpa giindan asiem sih ua, Mangpa’n Jakob tate Israel chia amin vawte kunga athupiehte leh adan thute, azuisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amaute toh Mangpa’n thuhun ana bawla, akung uah, “pasien dangte na giin ding uh ahisih a, amasang uah zong na kun ding uh ahisih a, ana u’zong semsih unlen, akung uah zong kithoi sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanleh silbawltheina nasatah leh banzah a Izipt gam a kipat a nou hing puidohpa Mangpa khu giing zaw unlen, Ama bie unlen Ama kungah kithoi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh Athupiehte, Avaihawmna dante, tualeh Athuchiemna dante, Ahing na gelpiehsate khantawn in na zui ding a, pasien dangte na giin dinguh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh na kung ua Ka thuhun pen na manghil ding uh ahisih a, pasien dangte zong na giin ding uh ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa na Pasian u’khu giing unlen, tuachi’n na melma zousiete uh khut a kipat in noute Ahing hundam ding hi,” chiin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bangteng hinan leh a thunung sih ua, tumasang lai a abieh dan bangbang un abawl nalai lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n tami namten Mangpa agiing ua, hinanleh atute atate u’toh a milim khenthute uh nna asem ua, apu apate uh bawl dandan in abawl nalai lai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel leengpa Elah tapa Hoshea kum thum leenga apan kum in, Juda leengpa Ahaz tapa Hezekiah leeng in ahing pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lenga apan chiil laiin kum sawmni leh nga a upa ahia, tualeh Jerusalem ah kum sawmni leh kumkuo leeng in apang hi. Anu min Abi ahia, Zekariah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh apu David sil bawlte zousie bawl in, Mangpa mitmu in sil hoitah abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman mun sangte aladoh a, milim khuomte a phua a, singa kibawl milimte asattan a, tualeh Mosi in anabawl sum-eng gul zong a susie a; khum hunlai tandong in Israel taten tuami kunga gimnamtui a hal nalai zieh un, tualeh amaun tua khu Nehushtan achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Israelte Mangpa Pasian amuonga; tuachi’n ama nua a Juda leengte zousie lah ah, ama bang koima aum nawn sih a, ama masangah zong koima ana um ngaisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen aman Mangpa atu chinten a, Ama nua azuina atawpsan nuom sih a, Mangpa’n Mosi kunga Apieh, Athupiehte apomdet zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa akungah auma; akuondohna pou ah alawching zel hi. Tualeh Assiria leengpa tungah ahel a, anna asem sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman Philistinte Gaza khuo tandongin, tualeh agam tan uh; galveng mite innsang apat khopi kulpinei tan in azou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Hezekiah kumli leenga apan nua in hichi ahia, Israel leengpa Elah tapa Hoshea kum sagi leenga apan kum in, Assiria leengpa Shalmaneser Samaria dou dingin akuontou a, ava imta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh kum thum abei tahin, ala ta ua. Tuakhu Hezekiah kum guh leenga apan kum leh Israel leengpa Hoshea leenga apan kum kuona ah Samaria khopi lahin aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Assiria leengpa’n Israelte Assiria gam ah sal in apuimanga tualeh amaute Gozan luipanga Halah leh Habor gam ah tualeh Medes khopite ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa a Pasian uh thu ana mang nuomsih ua, athuhun apalsan zawsop ua, Mangpa’n asuoh Mosi thu apiehte zousie; angaikhiet nuomlou zieh u’leh azui nuomlou zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Hezekiah kum sawm leh kumli leenga apan kum in, Assiria leengpa Sennakerib in Juda gam pumpi khopi kulpi neite dou dingin akuontou a, tualeh ava lata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Juda leengpa Hezekiah in Lakish khuo ah Assiria leengpa kungah mi asawl a, akungah “Sil kana bawlkhielta hi; hing nuakiasan mai inlen; na hing phut dandan ka bawlna ding hi,” chiin avaihah hi. Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa’n Juda leengpa Hezekiah dangka talent zathum leh sana talent sawmthum abituh pieh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah in Mangpa inn aum dangka taphot leh leengpa inn asum koina a um taphot a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin Hezekiah in Mangpa biehinn kotkhate leh a khuomte sana tui a aluonkhum zousie akipat sanate akhohkhe sienga Assiria leengpa apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa’n Tartan, Rabsari leh Rabshakeh te galkap tampi toh Lakish a kipat in Jerusalem a leengpa Hezekiah kungah asawl a. Tualeh akuontou ua, Jerusalem ava tung ua, ava tuntou tah un, puonsawpmite lamlien gei a tuikul sahtazaw tuilahna ah ava ding ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa ahat tah un, inn sunglam kemte lamkai, Hilkiah tapa Eliakim leh lai gielpa Shebna leh tanchin gielpa Asaph tapa Joah te ava pawtkhie uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rabshakeh in akung uah, “Tuin Hezekiah kungah gen unlen, leengpa thupitah Assiria leengpa’n tambangin agen hi, koi pang bela kimuong na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kidouna dingin lemguot siemna leh hatna ka nei na, na chi a; hinanleh tuate pen thulahlou ahi bou hi, koi muonga ka tunga hel na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin en in tam pumpeng chieng tawngsa Izipt muong na hi a; tua mi tunga mi akinga leh akhut asun ding hi. Tuabangin Izipt leengpa Pharaoh khu ama muongte zousie tungah ahi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahisihleh ka kunga “Mangpa ka Pasian uh ahi ka muon uh” na chi u’leh; ama khu Hezekiah in amun sangte leh amaitamte alahmanga, Judate leh Jerusalem mite kunga, Jerusalem ah “Tam maitam masangah Pasian na be ding uh, achi hilou ahiei mah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, ka pu Assiria leengpa toh thuchiem bawl inlen, tuachi’n sakol sangni ka hing pe dinga, atunga tuong ding namu nahding pouleh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Izipt te sakollengte leh sakol tungtuong mite muong nahi leh bangchidan in ahiei, ka pu suohte lah a galkap lamkai neu pen khat zong na nan zou mama ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa thu lou a tam mun suse dinga hing kuontou ka hiei mah? Mangpa’n ka kungah, tam gam dou dingin kuon inlen, va susie in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hilkiah tapa Eliakim, Shebna leh Joah in Rabshakeh kungah, “Hepitahin na suohte kungah Aramaik ham in thugen zawin, ka thei siem na uhi, tualeh kulpi tunga mite zah dingin Hebru ham in hing houpi nawnda maiin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh Rabshakeh in akung uah, “Ka pu’n, napu leh nang maimai kung a, tam thu gen dinga ahing sawl ahiei mah? kulpi tunga tou mite noute toh a eeh uh ne a, azun uh dawn dingte kungah zong ahing sawl hilou ahiei mah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rabshakeh adingdoh a, Juda hamin aw ngaitahin akikou a, tualeh “Leengpa thupitah Assiria leengpa thu ngai un!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tambangin leengpa’n agen hi; Hezekiah in hing sol sih heh, ka khut a kipat in ahing hunkhe theisih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hezekiah in Mangpa’n ahing hunkhe teitei dinga, tam khopi Assiria leengpa khut ah pieh ahisih ding, chiin Mangpa hing muong sah sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekiah thugen ngaikhe sih un; aziehpen Assiria leengpa’n tambangin agen hi; kipahman kengin ka kungah kilepna bawl unlen, ka kungah hing pei un, tuachi’n michin in ama grep kineh henlen, tualeh michinin ama theipi kunga theipi ga kineh chiet u’henlen, michin in ama tuikhuh a tui dawn chiet uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nouma gam mabanga bu leh uoin tha pienna gam, tanghou leh grep tui pienna gam, Olive sing leh khuoizu pienna gam, shi loua na hin theina ding gam ua ka hing pui masang sie’n; Hezekiah in Mangpa’n ahing humbit na ding hi chi a noute ahing sol chiengin zong tahsang sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Assiria leengpa khuta kipat in, Namte pasiente laha khat beeh in agam ahundoh kha mawngmawng tai mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hamath leh Arpad pasiente hei a umta uh adiei? Sepharvaimte, Hena te leh Ivah pasiente hei aum ata uoi? ka khuta kipat in Samaria khuo ahumbit uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gamte pasiente lah a koipen in ahiei, ka khuta kipat agam uh a hunkheta uoi? Mangpa’n ka khuta kipata Jerusalem ahutkhiet mama ding? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanleh mite asip dide ua, kam khat in zong adawng sih uhi; leengpa thupieh khu “Koiman dawng sih un,” chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n innlam kemte lamkai Hilkiah tapa Eliakimte, Laigielpa Shebnate, tanchin gielpa Asaph tapa Joah ten apuonsilte uh botkeh in leengpa Hezekiah kungah ava pei ua, Rab-Shakeh thugente ava hil uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahia, Hezekiah in tam thu a zah tahin, apuonsilte abotkeh a, sai ip puon asila, Mangpa inn ah alutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n innsung lam a lamkai Eliakim, laigielpa Shebna leh siempute lah a upate, sai ip puon sil in Amos tapa Isai kungah asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh amaun akung ah, “Hezekiah in tambang in agen hi, Tuni khu lungzin na phawhna leh minsietna ni ahi; aziehpen Naute lah apien uh ahunta a, pien sahna dingin lah hatna mawngmawng aum nawnta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pu Assiria leengpa’n Pasian hing gense dinga asawl Rab-Shakeh thugen zousie Mangpa na Pasian in anaza ahita maithei dinga, athu gente Mangpa na Pasian in Aza in, Ana phawh khata ding, tuaziehin aum sunte adingin aw ngaitah in thum pieh in” achi hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Hezekiah mi sawlte Isai kung ava tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Isai in akung uah, “Napu uh kungah tambangin na gen ding uhi. Mangpa’n tambang in achi hi, Assiria leengpa miten keima ahing gensiet thu na zah ziehin zausin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pellouin, asungah hagau ka umsah dinga, thuthang aza dinga, ama gam ah akinuale kia ding a, tuachi’n ama gamsung mama ah namsauin ka puasah ding hi,” achi hi, va chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rab-shakeh akinuale kia a, Assiria leengpa’n Libnah anadou laitah ava mu a; Lakish khuo apawt santa chi ana zahsa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh nangma hing dou dingin, Tirhakah Ethiopia leengpa “Akuondohta chi thuthang Sennakerib in azah tahin,” leengpa Hezekiah kungah mite asawl kia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tambangin Juda leengpa Hezekiah kungah thu nava gen ding uh ahi: Na muon na Pasian in Jerusalem Assiria leengpa khut ah piehkhieh ahisih ding chiin hing sol sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En in! Assiria leengten gamteng asuhsiet sieng ua, atung ua abawl dan uh na zata hi; nang humbit na hi tuom diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namte pasienten ka pule pate un ana suhsiette uh, Gozan, Haran, Rezeph leh Telassar gam sunga Eden mite, a humbit uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath leengpa, Arpad leengpa leh Sepharvaim khopi sung leengpa, Hena leengpa ahisihleh Ivah leengpate hei sunga um ahita uoi?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Hezekiah in a misawlte khut akipat in laithot amu a, asim a; tuachi’n Hezekiah Mangpa inn ah ava lut a, tualeh Mangpa mai ah laithot khu aphata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah in Mangpa masangah thu angen a; “Aw Mangpa Israelte Pasian. Cherubimte kikaal a um, leitung gam zousie ah Nang bou Pasian na hia, lei leh van Nangma siemsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa aw Na bil hing daw inlen, na ngaiin, Mangpa Namit hah inlen, Mangpa aw en in, Pasian hing gense dinga Sennakerib in ahing thugente ngaikhe vawi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa adihtahin, Assiria leengten namte leh gamte asuse ngut ma uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh apasiente uh zong mei sung ah apai zel uhi; ama haw pasiente ahisih ua, mihing khut a kibawlthu sing leh suongte ahi bou uhi, tuaziehin amaute asumang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Aw Mangpa ka Pasian uh, leitung gam zousie in Nang, Nangbou Mangpa Pasian nahi chi ahing theina ding un, akhut apat hing hundam in chiin,” ka hing ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amos tapa Isai in, Hezekiah kungah “Tambangin Israelte Mangpa Pasian in achi hi; ka kunga Assiria leengpa Sennakerib sietna dinga na ngetna ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami amapa tungtanga Mangpa thugen ahi: Zion tanu nungah siengthou in nang ahing simmaw a, chiemnui in ahing nuisan uhi, Jerusalem tanu in, nanua langah alu ang thin khum hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Koi na gensie a, koi namin sesah a, koi tungah ahiei na aw, nasan sah a, Na mit ha nasan sah? Israelte Misiengthoupa tungah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na mi sawlte zangin Mangpa na gensie a; “Ka sakolleng tampite toh, Lebanon gam gil a muol sangte, ka hing tungtouta a; khuna sidar sing sangtahtahte leh, taa sing deihuoi penpente ka phua dinga, agammang sung gil pen leh, gammang hoina pen ah ka lutding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gamdangah tuikhuhte ka tou a, gamdang tuite ka dawnta a, ka kengtaw in Izipt luite ka tuon kangta hi,” chi’n na kilien sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima’n nidanglai akipat tuate kabawl ahidan, tumasang lai akipata, ka siem ahidan, na zangai sih amah? Tuin khopi kulpi nei sesa chiengkhawm maimai banga um dingin, ka hing koiding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin asunga umten hatna aneisih ua, achimaw ua, azala gawpta uhi. Gamlah hampa bang leh loupa dawng bang, leh inn tung a hampa bangleh bu kung akhan let, masanga lung vei sieng bang mai ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanleh natenna mun, na lut leh na pawt, tualeh ka tunga na lungthah nate ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka tunga na lungthah zieh leh, ki uongsah taha na hamte ka bil ah ahing lut touta a, Tuaziehin ka siakawi na nahkuo ah ka thun dinga, na nephu ah ka siakuol ka vaw dinga, Na hing kuonna lam ma ah ka hing ki nuale sah ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami nanga dingin chiemtena ahi ding hi; tu kum in bu sang na ne ding ua, tualeh akum kia chieng in zong tua ma na neding uhi; tuabangin a kum thum na ah bu na tuu ding ua, at unlen, Grep guite suon unlen, aga na neding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Juda innkuonte lah a, asuohta um sunten, thahui aha suh ding ua, atung lam ah aga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jerusalem akipat in a um sunte, Zion muola kipat in adam nalaite, apawtdoh ding ua, Mangpa phattuomngaina in tamte abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n Assiria leengpa tungtang thu ah, tambangin agen hi; tam khopi sungah ahing lutsih dinga, athal zong ahing kaplut sihding a, tualeh tam khopi masangah lum toh ahing pei sih dinga, tualeh khopi kim ah leipal asep sang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahing kuonna lam ma ah akinuale kia dinga; tam khopi sungah ahing lutsih ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keima’n keima zieh leh ka suohpa David ziehin tam khopi hundam dingin ka veng ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khumi zan in Mangpa vansawlsieng akuon khie a, Assiriate giehphuola mi tul zakhat leh tul sawm giet leh tul nga ava that a; tualeh zingmawng matah a ahing thaw u’leh, mi shi luong ngen ana umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Assiria leengpa Sennakerib anua pei kiata a, tuachi’n Nineveh khopi ah aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, apasien Nisrok inn a apasien abieh laiin, ama tapate Adramelek leh Sharezer in namsau in ava thatta uhi. Tualeh Ararat gam ah ataimangta uhi. Tualeh atapa Esar-haddon ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hunlaiin Hezekiah shi ding khopin achina a, tualeh Amos tapa goulnei Isai akung ah ahing pei a, akungah, “Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Na innsung um danding sutupin, shi ding nahi, na damdoh zou nawn sih ding hi,” achi hi achia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah banglam nga in akihei a, Mangpa kungah thu angen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa, Na mai a gin umtah leh lungtang hoibukim a, ka gamtat dan leh Na mitmu a silhoi ka bawl zeldan thei zing in chiin athum a, tualeh Hezekiah hasetah in” akapta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, Isai in leengpa inn huongsung laita pen ahen masangin, Mangpa thu akungah ahing tunga, akungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nuakia inlen, ka mite lamkaipa Hezekiah kung ah vagen in, Mangpa napu David Pasian in hichiin achi hi, Na thumnate Kaza a, na hitui luong zong Ka mu hi, Ngaiin ka hing damsah dinga, nithum ni in Mangpa inn ah na haw tou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh na damsung kum sawm leh kum nga Ka belap ding, tualeh nang leh tam khopi Assiria leengpa akipat in Ka humbit dinga, tualeh Keima zieh leh Ka suoh David ziehin, tam khopi Ka vengbit ding hi, achi hi, chiin vagen in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Isai in “Theipi ga beu khat hing la un achia, tuachi’n ahing la ua, auilut ma ah abet a ahing dam kiata hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Hezekiah in Isai kungah, “Mangpa’n ahing damsah dinga, anithum niin Mangpa inn ah ka haw tou ding chi, achiemtena bang ahi diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Isai in akungah, “Mangpa’n agensa khu abawl teitei ding hi, chi tam chiemtena akipat in na mu ding hi; Nihim kalbi sawm akikhin tou ahiei na dei, ahisihleh kalbi sawm akinua khin?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Hezekiahin adawnga, “Nihim kalbi sawm akikhin abailam senga, tua hizawlou in Nihim kalbi sawm kinua khin zaw heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Isai in, Mangpa ahan a, tualeh Aman, Ahaz hunbi theina a nihim ngiemsa khu kalbi sawm akinua tawnsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Baladan tapa Babilon leengpa Merodak-baladan in, Hezekiah kungah lai hah leh kipahmante ahah a, Hezekiah a chi ana hi chi a zah zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah in amauh ana kipahpi a, asil manpha koina inn zousie a, dangkate, sanate, gimnamtuite, sathau mantamte, agalvan koina inn sungte, a gou umna inn sung zousie a en sah a; a inn sung leh agam sunga zousie Hezekiah in a amauh te a et sahlou mawngmawng a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zouin guolnei Isai leengpa Hezekiah kungah ahing pei a, a kungah, “Tam miten bang a gen uoi? Hei sunga kipat a nang kunga hing haw ahi uoi?” achi hi. Tualeh Hezekiah in, “Babilon gam, gamlapi akipata hing pei ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Isai in akungah, “Na inn ah bangbang amu uoi?” achia, tualeh Hezekiah in “Ka innsunga sil zousie amu sieng ua, ka goute amauh ka etsahlou mawngmawng a um sih hi,” chiin adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Isai in Hezekiah kungah, “Mangpa thu ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai vawi, ani ahing tung dinga, napu leh paten ana khol tuni tan a um, na inn sunga um zousie, Babilon gamsungah puohdoh in a um dinga; bangma nuasie mawngmawng a umsih ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh natu na tate, nahah nasuon hing pieng dingte zong sal in apuimang ding ua, Babilon leengpa inn ah michilge in a um ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah in Isai kungah, “Mangpa thu na gen khu ahoi hi,” achi hi. Tualeh aman “Ka damsunga lemna leh thutah a um ding pouleh, ahoi mai hilou i?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hezekiah tangthu dangte, asilbawltheidan zousie, tuikul leh tuilahna abawl dante, khopi sunga tui azawllut dante, Juda leengte khangthu kigelna laibu sungah atuong hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Hezekiah khu apulepate kungah a imuta a, tualeh ama thahengin atapa Manasseh leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh leenga apan chiillai in, kum sawm leh ni ahia, Tualeh Jerusalem khopi ah kum sawm nga leh kum nga leeng vai ahawm hi. Tualeh anu min khu Hephzibah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Israel tate masanga ana deldohsa namten sil kidahhuoitah ana bawlte uh bangbangin, Mangpa mitmuin sil hoilou tahtah abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Apa Hezekiah in asuhsietsa mun sangte abawlpha kia a, Baal adingin maitamte abawl kia a, tualeh Israelte leengpa Ahab bangin Asherte abawla, tualeh van a um zousie abie a, ana uh asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Jerusalem ah “Ka min Ka umsah ding” achina Mangpa inn ah maitamte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa inn huongsung nitegel ah van a um zousie a dingin maitam abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh atapa kithoina in mei ah ahallia a, aisante achiinga, bumte bang abawla, dawi aisan siemte leh dawi lawm neite toh akigopa, Mangpa sulungthah dingin Amitmu in silgilou chinteng abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n David leh Solomon kunga, “Tam inn leh Israel nam zousie lah a Kana tel Jerusalem ah, kum tawnin Ka min Ka umsah ngitnget ding chia Ana genna mun, Mangpa inn sungah, aman Asher milim kikhenthute aphut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Apu apate u’kunga ka piehsa gam a kipat in, Israelte keng ka vahvai sah nawn sih dinga, Ka suoh Mosi kunga Kana thupieh dan zousie leh akung ua Ka thupieh zousie banga bawl dinga, pilvang taha aum pou u’leh,” ana chisa mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun angaisah sih ua; tualeh Mangpa’n Israel tate masanga ana suhsietsa namte silbawl sanga zong gilouzaw sem bawl dingin Manasseh in mite azawl zawl zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n asuoh guolneite zang in thu agen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda leengpa Manasseh in, “Tam sil kidahhuoite ana bawla, ama masanga na um, Amormite sang in zong abawlkhiel huoise zaw thamtham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi; Ngaiin aza pouma bil lang ni khen dingin Jerusalem kho tung leh Juda gam tungah gimthuohna Ka hing tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Samaria tena khau leh Ahab innkuonte sialum kikhai ka zandoh dinga; miten akhup athal a kuong asuh sieng bangun, Jerusalem khopi ka nawt sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh ka goutan umsunte, ka taisan dinga amelmate u’khut ah ka pekhe dinga, amelmate uh kivah nan apang ding ua, midangte gal hingmatin apang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Apulepate uh Izipt gam a kipata, ahing pawtdoh ua kipat in, tuni dongin ka mitmu ah silgilou abawl ua, ahing suhlungthah zieh un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Manasseh in Jerusalem khopi agei langkhat a kipat ale lam gei tandong, mawnabei sisan tampi suo in aluong dim sah a, Judate akhiel sah a, akhelna bawl gentahlouin, Mangpa mitmuin silgilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Manasseh tanchin dangte, asilbawl zousie, asil bawlkhelnate, Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu sungah atuong asiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Manasseh apulepate kungah a imuta a, Uzza huona ama inn gei a, ahuonah avuita uhi. Tuachi’n atapa Amon ama taangin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amon leenga apan chiil in kum sawmni leh ni a upa ahia, Jerusalem ah kum ni leeng in apanga, anu min Meshullemeth ahia, Jotbah khuo a Heruz tanu ahi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Apa mabangin Mangpa mitmuin silgilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n apa lampi tot teng azui a, apa’n ana uh anasep leh ana bieh milimte bie in ana uh asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh apu apate Mangpa Pasian anuasie a, tualeh Mangpa dan bangin agamta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Amon suohten ama kalin thu aphiel ua, tualeh leengpa khu ama innsung ngei ah athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh agam mipiten leengpa Amon kala thuphiel zousie athat ua, tuachi’n agam mipiten atapa Josiah ama thahengin leeng in apang sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Amon silbawl dangte Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu sungah atuong asiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh ama Uzziah huon sunga, ama han ah akivuita a, atapa Josiah ama taangin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah leenga apan chiil in kum giet a upa ahia, Tualeh Jerusalem ah kum sawmthum leh khat leeng in apang hi. Tualeh anu min Jedidah ahia, Bozkath khuo a Adaiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh aman Mangpa mitmu in sil dihtah abawla, tualeh apu David lampi zousie azui a, zietlam ahiei, veilam ahiei ah zong apielsan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Josiah kum sawm leh giet achin kum in hichi ahi a, leengpa’n Meshullam tupa, Azaliah tapa laigielmi Shaphan, Mangpa inn ah asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Siempu lien Hilkiah kungah hawtou inlen, kotkha vengmiten mipite kunga ana lah khawm uh, Mangpa inn a kilalut dangkate sim u’henlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Mangpa inn a nasem lamkaite khutah pekhie u’henlen, tualeh amaun inn se munte bawlphatna dingin Mangpa inn a nasemte khut ah pe sawn uhenlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sing bawl siemte, inn bawlmite, tualeh innse bawlte kungah ape ding ua, inn bawl phatna ding sing leh suong khensate alei na dingun, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh muonhuoi tah a ana sai zel ziehun, akhut ua dangka apiehte uh aendih nawn sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh siempu lienpen Hilkiah in lai gielmi Shaphan kungah, “Mangpa inn sungah danlaibu ka mudohta,” achi hi. Tualeh Hilkiah in tua dan laibu khu Shaphan kungah apie a, aman asimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n laigielmi Shaphan, leengpa kungah ava haw a, leengpa kungah thu ava tut kia a. “Na nna semten inn a dangka umsunte ka la khawm ua, Mangpa inn a nasem lamkaite khutah ka pekhe siengta uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh laigielmi Shaphan in “Siempu Hilkiah in laibu khat ahing pie hi,” chiin leengpa alaata a, tualeh Shaphan in leengpa mai ah tuami asimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Lengpa’n dan laibu a thute azah tahin apuonte abotkeh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n siempu Hilkiah, Shaphan tapa Ahikam, Mikaiah tapa Akbor, laigielmi Shaphan leh leengpa nasem Asaiah te kungah thu apie a, akung uah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pei unlen, Kei dingin, mipite dingin, tualeh Juda gam pumpi a dingin, tam laibu kimudoh sunga thute tungtang Mangpa hing dongun; Ipu ipate un eima tungthu a ana kigiel zousie dungzui a bawl dingin tam laibu thute ana ngaisah lou ziehun, itung uah Mangpa thangpaina a sangsengta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siempu Hilkiah, Ahikam, Akbor, Shaphan leh Asaiahte, puonsil kempa Harhas tupa Tikvah tapa Shallum zi guolneinu Huldah kungah ava haw ua, Amanu Jerusalem khuo a ummun nina a um ahi a; tualeh ava houpita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n akung uah “Tambangin Mangpa Israelte Pasian in achi hi, ka kunga noute hing sawlpa hil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuziehin, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Ngai in, tam mun leh asunga tengte tungah sietna ka hing tungsah ding, Juda leengpa’n laibu sunga, athu sim tengteng bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin akhut nasepte ua, keima ahing suhthangpai theina dingun, ahing taisan ua, pasien dangte kungah gimnamtui ahal uhi; tuaziehin ka thangpaina tam mun tungah akuongzah dinga, suhmit ahi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa dong dinga nou hing sawlpa kungah hichibangin na chi ding uhi; Mangpa Israelte Pasian in hichibangin agen hi, na thuzah tungtang thu ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam mun leh asunga tengte, suhgam ding leh hamsietin ahing um ding uh chi thu ka genna zah bep a, na lungtang anema, Mangpa mai a na kingaingiem a, na puonte na bawkeh a, ka mai a na kaa ziehin ken zong na thu kana zata hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngaiin, na pule pate kungah ka hing pui dinga, na han ah lungmuong tah a puiin na um dinga, tam mun tunga sietna ka tun sah ding zousie na mitin amu sih ding” achi hi chiin, achi hi. Tualeh leengpa kungah thu ava tut kia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Juda gam leh Jerusalem khopi a upa zousie akunga han khawm dingin mi asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Juda gam a mi zousie leh Jerusalem khuo a mi zousie toh, siempute leh guolneite toh, mipi zousie toh, alien aneu in Mangpa inn ah apeitou ua, tualeh Mangpa inn a alaibu mudoh uh, thuhun laibu sunga kigiel zousie abil ua azah dingun asim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa khuom phungah adinga, tua laibu sunga kigiel thuhun thute sudet dingin, a lungtang zousie leh a hagau zousie a, Mangpa zui ding leh athupiehte, athu theisahte leh athugousiete pom dingin Mangpa mai ah thu ahunga, tualeh mipi zousie in zong thuhun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n siempu lienpen Hilkiah leh azom a siempute, tualeh kotkha vengmite Mangpa biehinn sunga Baal, Asher leh van a sil um zousie a dinga kibawl um leh bel zousie lakhe sieng dingin thu apie a; tualeh aman tuate khu, Jerusalem khopi pulama kidron loute ah ahaltuma, tualeh avutvamte khu Bethel ah apolut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh aman milimbie siempute, Juda leengten Juda gam mun sangte leh Jerusalem kimvel a munte a gimnamtui hal dinga, ana namdette uh atawpsah a, tualeh Baal ading, ni ading, hapi a ding, aasite a ding tualeh van a um zousie a dinga gimnamtui halte zong atawpsah sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa inn a, sing a kibawl milim khu, Jerusalem pulam a kidron lui dongin a ladoh a, tualeh kidron lui ah ahala, atuon buong dildel a, avuite minautangte han tungah athe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asher puon gaan numeite umna Mangpa inn a pasal kizuate umna innte aphesiet pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Juda khopite akipat in siempute zousie a puidoh a, Geba akipata Beersheba donga siempute gimnamtui halna mun sangte a suhbua pieh a; tualeh khopi kotkhah veilam panga um, vaihawmpa Joshua kot lutna a, mun sangte asuchim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh mun sang siempute pen, Jerusalema Mangpa maitam ah hawtou sih na’n u’leh, a unaute uh lah ah tanghou tolsawlou ane zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh koiman atapa ahiei, atanu ahiei, Molek biehna dinga mei a apei suoh sah louna dingun, Hinnom tate phaijang a um Tophet khu asubuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa innlutna inn huong sunga leengpa inn a innvengmi Nathan-Malek, dantan kunga, Juda leengten ni dinga alatsa uh sakolte alamanga; ni sakollengte mei in ahaltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Ahaz pindan tungnung zaw vum a, Juda leengten ana bawl uh maitamte, tualeh Mangpa innhuongte geela Manasseh maitam bawlte leengpa’n asuchima, asuguoi sienga, anengte kidron lui ah apai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa Solomon in, Sidon mite kidahhuoina Ashtoreth dinga, Moabmite kidahhuoina Kemosh ading, tualeh Ammonmite kidahhuoina Milkom ading banga abawl, thulimlouna muol zietlam aum, Jerusalem suolam a um mun sangte asubua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh milim suong kiphutte asuse gawp sienga, Asherte aphua a, tua munte mi shi guin asudim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Israelte khelna bawlsah Nebat tapa Jeroboam in, ana bawl Bethel a maitam leh amunsang nangawn pumin asuchim a, mun sangte ahaltuma, atuon guoi gawpa, Asherte ahaltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josiah ahing kileheileh muola hante amu a, mi asawl a, hante a mi shi gute ava lasah a, tam thute ana phuongdoh Pasian miin ana phuonsa Mangpa thu bangin, mishi gute khu maitam tungah ahal a asubuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Bang suongphu ahiei khuna ka mu?” achi hi. Tualeh khum khomiten Juda gam a kipata hing pei, “Bethel maitam tunga, na silbawl ding ana phuongdoh Pasian mipa hansuong ahi,” chi’n ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman, “Bangma lawsih un, koiman agute ladoh sih uheh,” achi hi. Tuachi’n agute Samaria gam akipata guolnei hing peipa gute toh bangma alawsih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Samaria khopi a um, Israel leengten, Mangpa suhlungthahna dinga abawl uh, mun sang innte zousie, Josiah in asumanga, tualeh Bethel khuo abawl mabangin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n maitam tunga um munsang siempute zousie, athat sienga, tuachi’n atungah mihing gute ahal a, tualeh Jerusalem ah akinuale ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n mi zousie kungah, “Tam thuhun laibu a kigiel mabangin Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin peikan pawi mangun,” chiin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel tunga vaihawm miten vaiahawm ua kipat in, Israel leengte zousie leh Juda leengte vaihawm sung tengin hichibangin peikan pawi ana nei kha nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa Josiah kumsawm leh giet leenga apan kum in Mangpa a dingin tam peikan pawi Jerusalem ah akimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuathamlouin siempu Hilkiah in, Mangpa inn a amudoh laibu a kigiel dan thute asuhbuchin theina dingin, aisan siemte, dawithu siemte, dawizawlte, innsung milim pasiente, tualeh Juda gam sung leh Jerusalem a, kidahhuoi kimu kha zousie, Josiahin apaimang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi dan dungzui a, alungtang zousie, ahinna zousie, tualeh ahatna zousie toh, Mangpa lam nga ama bang mawngmawng amasangin leengpa koima ana um kha sih a, ama nuain zong koima a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuchi pumpumin zong, Mangpa’n alungthahna thupitah, Manasseh in athangpai sahna zousie zieh a. Juda tunga alungthahna kuongzah apat in akilehei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n “Israelte ka suonmang bangin Judate zong ka muphahlouna ah ka suonmang dinga, ka tel tam Jerusalem ngel leh khunah ka min a um ding kana chi ngel khu ka paimang ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Josiah tanchin dangte, asilbawl zousie, Juda leengte khangthu kigelna laibu ah atuong hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Avaihawm laiin Izipt leengpa Pharaoh-neko, Assiria leengpa dou dingin Euphrates luiah akuontou a, tualeh leengpa Josiahin ama avadou a, tualeh Pharaoh Neko in ama amutahin Megiddo kidouna galphuol ah athatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n a miten Megiddo akipat in aluong sakolleng in apuo ua, Jerusalem ah ahing polut ua, ama han ah avuita uhi. Tuachi’n khum gam miten, Josiah tapa Jehoahaz apui ua, sathau anu ua, tualeh apa taangin leengpa in abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoahaz leenga apan chiillai in kum sawmni leh thum ahia, tualeh Jerusalem ah hathum leeng vai ahawm hi. Tualeh anu min Hamutal ahia, Libnah khuo a, Jeremiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh apulepate mabangin Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Pharaoh Neko in, Jerusalem a vaihawm thei nawn lou dingin Hamath gam a Riblah khuo ah suongkul ah akhum a, tualeh agam uh dangka talent za khat leh sana talent khat sie alieu sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharaoh Neko in leengpa Josiah tapa Eliakim apa Josiah taangin leeng in apangsah a, amin zong Jehoiakim chi’n ahen piehta hi. Pharaoh in Jehoahaz Izipt gam ah apui a, khunah apei a, ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoiakim in dangka leh sana Pharaoh kungah apie a, hinanleh Pharaoh thupieh dungzui a, sum pe dingin agam ah sie alieu sah hi. Pharaoh-Neko kunga pieh dingin michin alieu dinga aguot za chiet bangin agamsunga mite dangka leh sana alieu sah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lenga apan chiil in Jehoiakim khu kum sawmni leh kum nga a upa ahia, tualeh Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh khat leeng in apang hi. Tualeh anu min Zebudah ahia, Rumah khuo a Pedaiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh apulepate bawl dan bangbangin, Mangpa mitmuin silgilou abawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoiakim vaihawm hunlaiin, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in agam ahing dou a, tualeh Jehoiakim zong ama thuneina nuoi ah kumthum sung a um a, khumnua in akiheisan a, atungah ahelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ama dou dingin Kaldai galkap honte, Siria galkap honte, Moab galkap honte tualeh Ammon hahlesuon honte asawlta a, asuoh guolneite zanga agen Mangpa thu bangin Juda gam suse dingin asawlkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Manasseh khelnate, asilbawl zousie zieh a, amu phahlou a, amauh suonmang dingin tam Judate tungah Mangpa thupieh ahingtung petma ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh mawnabei sisan asuo zieh zong ahia, mawna neilou sisan in Jerusalem adim sah ziehin, Mangpa’n angaidam nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiakim tanchin dangte, asilbawl zousie Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah atuong hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiakim apulepate kungah a imuta a, tuachi’n atapa Jehoiakin ataangin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Izipt leengpa agam akipat in ahing kuon kia nawn sih hi. Aziehpen Babilon leengpa’n Izipt lui a kipat Euphrates lui tan Izipt leenggam ala siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leenga apan chiil laiin Jehoiakin kum sawm leh kum giet ahia, tualeh Jerusalem ah ha thum vai ahawm hi. Tualeh anu min Nehushta ahia, Jerusalem a um Elnathan tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh apa bawl dan zousie mabangin, Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khumhunlaiin, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar mite Jerusalem dou dingin akuontou a, tualeh khopi ahing imta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh khumbanga amiten aimkhum lai un Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar khum khopi dou dingin ahing kuontou a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda leengpa Jehoiakin khu, anu, asuohte, amiliente leh alamkaite toh Babilon leengpa kungah ava kipe khie ua, tualeh Babilon leengpa’n, avaihawm kum gietna in Jehoiakin ana man a, ahentaangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ana gentah mabangin, Nebukadnezzar in Mangpa inn a gou zousie leh leengpa inn a gou zousie apodoh a, tualeh Mangpa biehinn a, Israel leengpa Solomon in ana bawl sana um leh belte asatguoi sienga apomangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem a mi zousie, milien tengteng, mihat hangsan leh silbawlthei zousie leh saltang mi tul sawm toh, tualeh khutsiem leh siakhen siem mi zousie apui siengta a; Agam sunga mi zawng leh chimawte loungal koima anuasie nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh aman Jehoiakin khu Babilon ah sal in apuita a, tualeh leengpa nu, leengpa zite, amiliente, agam a mihatte, Jerusalem a kipat in Babilon ah sal in apui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Babilon leengpa’n pasal hat leh hangsan ngen tul sagi, khut siem leh siakhen siem mi tul khat, mi hat leh galdou thei ngentang, Babilon ah sal in apui siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon leengpa’n, Jehoiakin paneu Mattaniah, ama thahengin leeng in apang sah a, tualeh amin Zedekiah chi’n ahen pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zedekiah leenga apan chiil in, kum sawmni leh khat ahi a, tualeh Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh khat vai ahawm hi. Tualeh anu min Hamutal ahia, Libnah khuo a Jeremiah tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoiakim bawl dan zousie bangin, Mangpa mitmu in silgiloute abawl zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa lungthahna ziehin amitmu akipat apaimang masangsie in, Jerusalem leh Juda gam tungah tam silte ahing tung zel hi. Tuachi’n Zedekiah khu Babilon leengpa tungah ahelta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah leenga apan kum kuo na, ha sawmna ni sawmni in, hichi ahing hi a, Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar agalkap zousie toh Jerusalem dou dingin ahing kuontou ua, panmun abawl ua, tualeh akim vel ah, kulte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n akhopi khu leengpa Zedekiah vaihawm kum sawm leh khatna dongin a imkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aha lina ni kuo niin, khopi sungah kiel ahing naseta a, agam mite a dingin neh ding mawngmawng a umta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi kulbang a suvang ua, Babilon miten khopi a imkuol vang un, galkap thei mi zousie zanlai in leengpa huon gei a, bang nite kikaal lampi ah ataimangta uhi. Tualeh leengpa khu phaijang lam nawin apei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Babilon galkapten leengpa Zedekiah anuadel ua, Jeriko phaijang ah anua phah ua, agalkapten ataizah san siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa aman ua, Riblah khuo a Babilon leengpa kungah azawpi ua, tualeh atungtang thu angaituo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Zedekiah tapa khu amitmu ngei ah athat ua, tualeh Zedekiah mit akheu khie ua, sum-eng kol abul sah ua, tualeh Babilon gam dong apui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar vaihawm kum sawm leh kum kuona ha ngana ni sagi niin Babilon leengpa veng pawla galkap lamkai Nebuzaradan Jerusalem ah ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman Mangpa inn meiin ahal a, leengpa inn leh Jerusalem a inn zousie, miliente inn teng zong mei in ahal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh galkap lamkaipa kunga um Babilon galkapte zousie in Jerusalem kimkot a kulbangte a suchim sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi sunga um nalaite leh Babilon leengpa kunga na kipelutte, tualeh mipi um nalaite zousie, vengpawl a galkap lamkai Nebuzaradan in sal in apuimang siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh galkap lamkai pa’n agam sunga mi zawng leh genthei, grep gui kem ding leh lou hou ding in anuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa inn a sum-eng khuomte leh atunnate, tualeh sum-eng a kibawl tuikuong lienpi Babilon galkap ten asatse dildel ua, tuate Babilon gam ah apomang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh belte vut luohnate, thaumei puon tetannate, tawkeute sum eng a kibawl, siemputen azah uh um leh bel zousie zong a lamang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh mei lah na kuong, maiphiet kuongte toh, sana leh dangka a kibawlte zousie Babilon galkap lamkai pan alamang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon in Mangpa inn a dinga abawl, khuom nite, tuikuonglien leh atunnate, tam sum-eng bel leh kuongte zousie agihdan theiseng guollou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuom khat sandan khu tong sawm leh giet ahia, atungvum a alihbaw khu sum eng ahia, alihbaw san dan tong thum ahia, tualeh abaw tungah, apawl bilbiel bang, kawlbutheite abaw kimvel ah sum-eng ngen in akizema, tualeh hichibang main, akhuom khat pen zong akizem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh galkap lamkai pa’n, siempu lienpen Seraiah, siempu nina Zephaniah, tualeh kotkhah vengmi thum aman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khopi sunga kipat in galkap thei mite lamkai khat leh leengpa thumoptu apang mi nga khopi sung a um nalaite tualeh, galkapte laigiel lienpen agam mipite tunga thuneipa leh khopi sunga um agam mite sawm guh aman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap lamkai lien Nebuzaradan in tam mite aman a, Riblah khuo Babilon leengpa kungah apeipita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Babilon leengpa’n Hamath gam a Riblah khuo ah amauh athatta hi. Tuachi’n Judate agam ua kipat in puimangin a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in Juda gam anuasie lai a, a gam a um nalai mite tungah Shaphan tupa Ahikam tapa Gedaliah vaihawm dingin apang sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkap pawl lamkaite zousie leh amite un Babilon leengpa’n Gedaliah vaihawmtu dingin apangsah ta chi azah tahun Mizpah khuo a Gadaliah kungah ahaw ua, tuate khu Nethaniah tapa Ishmael, Kareah tapa Johanan, Netophath mi Tanhumeth tapa Seraiah, Makathmi tapa Jaazaniah te khu amite uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gedaliah khu ama u’leh amite uh masangah akichiema, akung uah “Babilonte suoha um ding zau sih un, tam gam ah umzing unlen, tualeh Babilon leengpa nna sem un, tuachi’n nou a dingin ahoi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh aha sagi na ah, hichi ahing hia, leengpa insungmi, Elishma tapa Nethaniah tapa Ishmael mi sawm toh ahing kuon ua, Gadaliah leh Judate tualeh Babilon mi akunga aumpite toh ava that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh mipi zousie alien aneuin galkap lamkaite nasan zong akisa ua, Izipt gam ah apeita uhi; Babilon mite agiin sengseng zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Juda leengpa Jehoiakin sal tanna kum sawm thum leh kum sagina, aha sawm leni na, ani sawmni leh sagi niin, Babilon leengpa Evil-Merodak avaihawm pat kum in Juda leengpa Jehoiakin khu suongkul akipat in aha dohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Akungah hepina neitahin thu agen a, tualeh Babilon a aumpi leengte leengtouna sanga thupizaw ah, atou sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiakin in asuongkul tanna puonsilte ahenga, tualeh adamsung tengin leengpa toh ann ane khawm ngitnget ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n alaw ding apie a, tualeh adam sung teng nichin a, atulmaw dungzui in tanvou atuom in abawl pieh nalai hi.
  </para>
</usx>
